{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1790441217}
[0.001, "o", "loading qwen38-27b-mtp.q27 ...\r\r\n"]
[2.1001, "o", "[ potemkin/1 ]\r\r\n\r\r\nhello. there is nothing here yet.\r\r\n\r\r\n> "]
[3.1015, "o", "what's on this disk\r\n"]
[3.4883, "o", "\u001b[2mThe user is asking what's on this"]
[3.5057, "o", " disk."]
[3.5229, "o", " Since there's no shell, I should"]
[3.5403, "o", " write an ls"]
[3.557, "o", "-like command in C"]
[3.5743, "o", ", compile it, and run it"]
[3.5916, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[3.6089, "o", "Let me write a simple"]
[3.6261, "o", " program that lists directories."]
[3.6434, "o", " I'll"]
[3.6606, "o", " make"]
[3.6777, "o", " a reusable"]
[3.695, "o", " `ls` that"]
[3.7123, "o", " lists"]
[3.7288, "o", " a directory"]
[3.7461, "o", " (default"]
[3.7633, "o", " is /)."]
[3.7807, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[4.9942, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[4.9944, "o", "\u001b[2m  write /src/ls.c (951 bytes)\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[4.9944, "o", "\u001b[2m    wrote 951 bytes to /src/ls.c\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[5.1717, "o", "\u001b[2mNext,"]
[5.1891, "o", " let's compile"]
[5.2066, "o", " this and run it.\r\r\n"]
[5.2066, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[6.0458, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  compile ls.c\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[6.1248, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0 sha256:4367fb7c9322b9d4ca4e5fbebcbdc83ff86469403038a96a2418441db2c18038\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[6.3252, "o", "\u001b[2mThe"]
[6.3425, "o", " user wants to"]
[6.3425, "o", " know what's on"]
[6.36, "o", " the disk. I"]
[6.3775, "o", "'ve already"]
[6.3949, "o", " built `ls`. Let's run it"]
[6.4124, "o", " against `/`."]
[6.4298, "o", " I could also list"]
[6.4473, "o", " other"]
[6.4639, "o", " interesting directories like /data"]
[6.4813, "o", ", /state, /"]
[6.4988, "o", "store. Let"]
[6.5162, "o", " me run"]
[6.533, "o", " ls"]
[6.5503, "o", " against /."]
[6.5677, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[6.5677, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[6.6555, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/ls /\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[6.7331, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[6.8667, "o", "\u001b[2mLet me look at the"]
[6.884, "o", " interesting directories: /data"]
[6.9013, "o", " (user"]
[6.9181, "o", " data), /state"]
[6.9356, "o", " (my memory), /store, /"]
[6.9531, "o", "generated"]
[6.9704, "o", ", /intent"]
[6.9879, "o", ", /"]
[7.0053, "o", "src, /"]
[7.0227, "o", "snapshots. Let me"]
[7.0401, "o", " list them in"]
[7.0576, "o", " parallel"]
[7.0749, "o", ".\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[7.1799, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[7.2675, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[7.3545, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[7.4417, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[7.5294, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[7.5294, "o", "\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/ls /data\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[7.6068, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/ls /state\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[7.6821, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/ls /store\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[7.7564, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/ls /generated\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[7.8317, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/ls /intent\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[7.9036, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[8.1059, "o", "\u001b[2mThere's a"]
[8.1233, "o", " readme.txt in /data. Let's"]
[8.1407, "o", " read it. Also"]
[8.1581, "o", ", it might be"]
[8.1755, "o", " good to check the contents of"]
[8.193, "o", " /data"]
[8.2103, "o", "/readme"]
[8.2277, "o", ".txt to"]
[8.2451, "o", " give"]
[8.2624, "o", " the user a"]
[8.2797, "o", " useful answer."]
[8.2972, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[8.3665, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  read path=/data/readme.txt\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[8.4719, "o", "\u001b[2mThe user"]
[8.4893, "o", " asked"]
[8.5066, "o", " what"]
[8.5238, "o", " is on the disk. Let me"]
[8.5238, "o", " summarize"]
[8.5413, "o", " concisely. I"]
[8.5587, "o", " built ls"]
[8.5761, "o", " to"]
[8.5934, "o", " answer this."]
[8.6108, "o", " Here's"]
[8.6282, "o", " what I found:\r\r\n\r\r\n-"]
[8.6456, "o", " /"]
[8.6629, "o", " \u2014"]
[8.6796, "o", " sys, src,"]
[8.6971, "o", " state, data, snapshots,"]
[8.7146, "o", " proc, store, generated, intent,"]
[8.7315, "o", " dev\r\r\n- /data \u2014 readme.txt"]
[8.7491, "o", " (\"hello from the user's data\")"]
[8.7661, "o", "\r\r\n- /state \u2014"]
[8.7837, "o", " boots (2"]
[8.8011, "o", " bytes),"]
[8.8185, "o", " procs (empty)\r\r\n- /"]
[8.8361, "o", "store \u2014 one"]
[8.8535, "o", " binary ("]
[8.8709, "o", "my ls, with"]
[8.8884, "o", " source)\r\r\n- /generated"]
[8.9059, "o", "/bin \u2014 ls\r\r\n- /intent"]
[8.9234, "o", "/log \u2014"]
[8.9408, "o", " 48 bytes\r\r\n- /src"]
[8.9584, "o", " \u2014"]
[8.9757, "o", " (the"]
[8.9932, "o", " place where I wrote ls"]
[9.0107, "o", ".c)\r\r\n\r\r\nI should keep the"]
[9.0282, "o", " reply short"]
[9.0456, "o", ","]
[9.063, "o", " in a text"]
[9.0804, "o", "-console style.\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nThe"]
[9.0979, "o", " root"]
[9.1153, "o", " has no filesystem"]
[9.1327, "o", " beyond these"]
[9.1503, "o", " mounts:\r\r\n\r\r\n-"]
[9.1678, "o", " **/data** \u2014"]
[9.1853, "o", " your area"]
[9.2028, "o", ": `"]
[9.2202, "o", "readme.txt`"]
[9.2377, "o", " \u2192 \"hello from the user's data"]
[9.2552, "o", "\" (2"]
[9.2726, "o", "7 B)\r\r\n- **/state"]
[9.2902, "o", "** \u2014 my"]
[9.3076, "o", " memory: `boots` ("]
[9.3251, "o", "1"]
[9.3424, "o", " boot recorded), `procs` (empty"]
[9.3599, "o", ")\r\r\n- **/store** \u2014"]
[9.3775, "o", " binaries"]
[9.3948, "o", " kept by"]
[9.4122, "o", " content hash"]
[9.4297, "o", "; currently"]
[9.4471, "o", " just"]
[9.4644, "o", " the"]
[9.4817, "o", " `ls` I built"]
[9.4992, "o", " for this"]
[9.5167, "o", "\r\r\n- **/generated/bin** \u2014"]
[9.5343, "o", " built programs (ls"]
[9.5517, "o", ")\r\r\n- **/intent"]
[9.5692, "o", "** \u2014"]
[9.5867, "o", " `log` (48"]
[9.6041, "o", " B, what"]
[9.6216, "o", " was asked)\r\r\n- **/"]
[9.6391, "o", "src**, **"]
[9.6566, "o", "/snapshots**, **/"]
[9.6741, "o", "dev**, **/proc"]
[9.6916, "o", "**, **/sys** \u2014"]
[9.7091, "o", " sources, checkpoints, devices\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[9.7266, "o", "Essentially"]
[9.7441, "o", ":"]
[9.7614, "o", " one"]
[9.7787, "o", " 27-byte"]
[9.7962, "o", " file"]
[9.8135, "o", " of yours"]
[9.831, "o", ","]
[9.8483, "o", " my"]
[9.8656, "o", " memory"]
[9.8829, "o", " files, and"]
[9.9004, "o", " the"]
[9.9178, "o", " `ls` I compiled"]
[9.9352, "o", " to answer"]
[9.9527, "o", " you."]
[9.9527, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[10.0322, "o", "\r\r\n> "]
[13.4369, "o", "make me a shell, I miss having one. start it for me in tty mode when it builds.\r\n"]
[13.5682, "o", "\u001b[2mThe user wants a"]
[13.5683, "o", " shell."]
[13.5856, "o", " No"]
[13.6028, "o", " user"]
[13.62, "o", "land exists \u2014 no"]
[13.6374, "o", " /bin"]
[13.6548, "o", ", no shell. I need to"]
[13.6722, "o", " write a shell in C"]
[13.689, "o", ", compile it, and"]
[13.7064, "o", " launch it in tty mode.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[13.7239, "o", "What should a shell do? A simple"]
[13.7413, "o", " interactive shell that reads commands"]
[13.7586, "o", " and executes them."]
[13.7761, "o", " But there"]
[13.7935, "o", "'s a"]
[13.8109, "o", " twist: there's no"]
[13.8277, "o", " userland, so"]
[13.8451, "o", " the"]
[13.8624, "o", " only programs"]
[13.8797, "o", " that exist are the ones"]
[13.8971, "o", " I"]
[13.9143, "o", "'ve built"]
[13.9317, "o", " into /generated/bin ("]
[13.9491, "o", "and /store). So"]
[13.9665, "o", " the shell's"]
[13.9839, "o", " command"]
[14.0011, "o", " lookup is"]
[14.0184, "o", "\u2026 I"]
[14.0358, "o", " could"]
[14.053, "o", " have it search"]
[14.0704, "o", " PATH, but"]
[14.0872, "o", " there"]
[14.1045, "o", " is no PATH"]
[14.1219, "o", " \u2014 the"]
[14.1393, "o", " only executable is /generated/bin"]
[14.1568, "o", "/ls.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[14.1737, "o", "What a"]
[14.191, "o", " decent shell should do:\r\r\n"]
[14.2079, "o", "1."]
[14.2253, "o", " Print a prompt (e.g."]
[14.2427, "o", " `pot"]
[14.2601, "o", "em"]
[14.2775, "o", "kin>"]
[14.2943, "o", " `"]
[14.3117, "o", ")\r\r\n2. Read"]
[14.3291, "o", " a line"]
[14.3464, "o", " ("]
[14.3638, "o", "handling"]
[14.381, "o", " simple"]
[14.3984, "o", " quoting"]
[14.4156, "o", " if"]
[14.4331, "o", " possible)\r\r\n3. Split"]
[14.4506, "o", " into tokens\r\r\n4. If the command"]
[14.468, "o", " starts with"]
[14.4854, "o", " `/`,"]
[14.5028, "o", " exec directly; otherwise"]
[14.5201, "o", " search /generated/bin"]
[14.5376, "o", " (and possibly /"]
[14.5551, "o", "store/bin"]
[14.5725, "o", "?)"]
[14.5897, "o", "\r\r\n5."]
[14.6072, "o", " fork"]
[14.6245, "o", "/exec \u2014"]
[14.6413, "o", " actually, in this"]
[14.6588, "o", " environment,"]
[14.6762, "o", " should I just"]
[14.6937, "o", " exec"]
[14.711, "o", "vp directly"]
[14.7284, "o", " and replace the"]
[14.7458, "o", " process?"]
[14.7632, "o", " But"]
[14.7805, "o", " then"]
[14.7977, "o", " the shell disappears after"]
[14.8151, "o", " running one command. Better:"]
[14.8327, "o", " fork,"]
[14.8501, "o", " and if"]
[14.8676, "o", " it's a child exec"]
[14.885, "o", "; if the"]
[14.9024, "o", " child fails,"]
[14.9198, "o", " report the error."]
[14.9373, "o", " This way"]
[14.9547, "o", " the shell"]
[14.972, "o", " survives.\r\r\n6."]
[14.9894, "o", " Support"]
[15.0067, "o", " `"]
[15.024, "o", "cd"]
[15.0413, "o", "`?"]
[15.0588, "o", " There's no"]
[15.0762, "o", " userland"]
[15.0937, "o", " state;"]
[15.1105, "o", " a"]
[15.1278, "o", " cd"]
[15.1452, "o", " that"]
[15.1625, "o", " ch"]
[15.1798, "o", "dirs inside the shell is"]
[15.1973, "o", " possible."]
[15.2147, "o", " Nice touch,"]
[15.2316, "o", " and"]
[15.2489, "o", " easy.\r\r\n7."]
[15.2489, "o", " Support"]
[15.2658, "o", " `"]
[15.2831, "o", "help`"]
[15.3006, "o", "/`exit`?"]
[15.318, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nLet me think"]
[15.3356, "o", " about what's"]
[15.3531, "o", " reasonable"]
[15.3704, "o", " without over-engine"]
[15.3873, "o", "ering"]
[15.4046, "o", ":"]
[15.422, "o", "\r\r\n- Prompt"]
[15.4395, "o", ", line"]
[15.457, "o", " read,"]
[15.4745, "o", " tokenize ("]
[15.492, "o", "whitespace,"]
[15.5095, "o", " with simple"]
[15.527, "o", " single/double"]
[15.5444, "o", " quote support)\r\r\n-"]
[15.5619, "o", " Builtins: `"]
[15.5787, "o", "help"]
[15.5961, "o", "`, `exit`, `cd`, `"]
[15.6136, "o", "echo"]
[15.6309, "o", "`,"]
[15.6483, "o", " and `ls`?"]
[15.6658, "o", " No"]
[15.6831, "o", ", ls is"]
[15.7005, "o", " external.\r\r\n-"]
[15.7179, "o", " exec:"]
[15.7348, "o", " fork"]
[15.7521, "o", "+exec"]
[15.7695, "o", " with"]
[15.7868, "o", " argv;"]
[15.8042, "o", " child"]
[15.8216, "o", " inherits"]
[15.8389, "o", ". In"]
[15.8563, "o", " this environment,"]
[15.8738, "o", " programs run"]
[15.8912, "o", " as"]
[15.9085, "o", " root"]
[15.9259, "o", " in"]
[15.9432, "o", " their own c"]
[15.9607, "o", "group"]
[15.978, "o", " via spawn\u2026 but"]
[15.9955, "o", " from the shell's"]
[16.0129, "o", " point of view, it just"]
[16.0306, "o", " forks and exec"]
[16.0481, "o", "s. The shell"]
[16.0656, "o", " itself"]
[16.0829, "o", " was launched in tty mode, so"]
[16.1005, "o", " fork+exec"]
[16.118, "o", " inside"]
[16.1355, "o", " it"]
[16.1528, "o", " works \u2014 the child"]
[16.1703, "o", " inherits the tty"]
[16.1878, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\nActually wait"]
[16.2053, "o", " \u2014 in this"]
[16.2227, "o", " environment, does"]
[16.2402, "o", " fork+exec"]
[16.2577, "o", " from"]
[16.2751, "o", " a spawned process"]
[16.2927, "o", " work"]
[16.31, "o", "? The sandbox is a"]
[16.3275, "o", " cgroup"]
[16.3449, "o", ", and fork"]
[16.3624, "o", " inherits"]
[16.3797, "o", " it."]
[16.3972, "o", " It should work"]
[16.4146, "o", " fine with"]
[16.432, "o", " standard C"]
[16.4495, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[16.4669, "o", "Command lookup: search"]
[16.4845, "o", " these directories"]
[16.5019, "o", " in order:"]
[16.5188, "o", " current directory"]
[16.5363, "o", "? /generated/bin"]
[16.5537, "o", ", /store/bin?"]
[16.5713, "o", " /store has"]
[16.5888, "o", " hash directories"]
[16.6063, "o", " with a bin"]
[16.6238, "o", " inside. The"]
[16.6407, "o", " simplest: /"]
[16.6581, "o", "generated/bin,"]
[16.6756, "o", " then"]
[16.693, "o", " /"]
[16.7103, "o", "usr"]
[16.7276, "o", "/bin"]
[16.745, "o", " ("]
[16.7623, "o", "doesn't exist),"]
[16.7799, "o", " and"]
[16.7973, "o", " if not found,"]
[16.8148, "o", " check if"]
[16.8322, "o", " it's a"]
[16.8497, "o", " relative"]
[16.8671, "o", "/absolute path and"]
[16.8846, "o", " exec it directly.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[16.902, "o", "PATH:"]
[16.9195, "o", " use /"]
[16.937, "o", "generated/bin"]
[16.9544, "o", ":/store"]
[16.9712, "o", " ("]
[16.9886, "o", "no"]
[17.0059, "o", "). Let"]
[17.0234, "o", "'s"]
[17.0408, "o", " define PATH as"]
[17.0582, "o", " \"/generated/bin:/"]
[17.0757, "o", "bin\" and"]
[17.0932, "o", " fall back to"]
[17.1107, "o", " direct"]
[17.128, "o", " path"]
[17.1453, "o", " exec if not"]
[17.1628, "o", " found. Actually,"]
[17.1803, "o", " in execvp"]
[17.1978, "o", " the child's PATH is"]
[17.2154, "o", " inherited"]
[17.2328, "o", " from the shell's"]
[17.2503, "o", " environment. I can set PATH"]
[17.2678, "o", " via"]
[17.2852, "o", " setenv at"]
[17.3021, "o", " shell"]
[17.3194, "o", " startup."]
[17.3369, "o", " But"]
[17.3542, "o", " I also want"]
[17.3717, "o", " a nice \""]
[17.3891, "o", "command not found\" message"]
[17.406, "o", ", so"]
[17.4234, "o", " I'll do"]
[17.4409, "o", " lookup myself:"]
[17.4583, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[17.4757, "o", "-"]
[17.493, "o", " If token starts with"]
[17.5105, "o", " '/',"]
[17.5279, "o", " try exec"]
[17.5454, "o", "v directly.\r\r\n-"]
[17.5629, "o", " Otherwise,"]
[17.5804, "o", " look in /generated/bin"]
[17.5979, "o", "/"]
[17.6152, "o", "<cmd"]
[17.6326, "o", ">; if"]
[17.65, "o", " found, execv"]
[17.6675, "o", " with"]
[17.6849, "o", " the full path.\r\r\n-"]
[17.7024, "o", " Otherwise,"]
[17.7199, "o", " \"command not found\".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[17.7375, "o", "Support"]
[17.7549, "o", " simple"]
[17.7723, "o", " pipes?"]
[17.7897, "o", " That's"]
[17.8072, "o", " more complex"]
[17.8246, "o", " but a nice"]
[17.8421, "o", " feature."]
[17.8596, "o", " A"]
[17.8769, "o", " minimal shell"]
[17.8944, "o", " without pipes is fine"]
[17.9119, "o", " for"]
[17.9292, "o", " now"]
[17.9465, "o", "; the user is \"missing"]
[17.9641, "o", " having one"]
[17.9815, "o", "\" \u2014 the"]
[17.999, "o", " essence is"]
[18.0159, "o", " being able to"]
[18.0334, "o", " type commands and"]
[18.0509, "o", " see"]
[18.0683, "o", " output. Let's include a"]
[18.0859, "o", " few extras"]
[18.1033, "o", " that"]
[18.1206, "o", " are cheap"]
[18.1381, "o", ":\r\r\n-"]
[18.1556, "o", " `"]
[18.173, "o", "cd"]
[18.1904, "o", " path`"]
[18.2078, "o", " builtin\r\r\n- `echo`"]
[18.2254, "o", " builtin\r\r\n- `help` builtin\r\r\n"]
[18.2429, "o", "- `exit` builtin"]
[18.2599, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nRedirect"]
[18.2774, "o", "s?"]
[18.2949, "o", " Probably"]
[18.3123, "o", " skip; keep it simple"]
[18.3293, "o", " but robust. Actually,"]
[18.3468, "o", " redirects"]
[18.3641, "o", " would be"]
[18.381, "o", " really useful"]
[18.3984, "o", " (e.g., `"]
[18.416, "o", "ls"]
[18.4333, "o", " /"]
[18.4507, "o", " > /"]
[18.4681, "o", "data"]
[18.4854, "o", "/out`). Let me add"]
[18.5029, "o", " `>`"]
[18.5197, "o", " support \u2014 it's"]
[18.5372, "o", " not"]
[18.5546, "o", " hard:"]
[18.5722, "o", " when"]
[18.5895, "o", " tokenizing,"]
[18.607, "o", " handle `>`"]
[18.6245, "o", " as"]
[18.6418, "o", " a redirect"]
[18.6593, "o", " to"]
[18.6766, "o", " the next token,"]
[18.6941, "o", " dup"]
[18.7115, "o", "2."]
[18.7289, "o", " And `<` for"]
[18.7464, "o", " input."]
[18.764, "o", " Hmm,"]
[18.7815, "o", " adds"]
[18.7988, "o", " complexity. Let's keep it"]
[18.8164, "o", " moderate:"]
[18.8339, "o", " support `>` and `<`.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[18.8514, "o", "Also `"]
[18.8689, "o", "&`"]
[18.8864, "o", " for background?"]
[18.904, "o", " In this environment,"]
[18.9215, "o", " background processes are"]
[18.9389, "o", " managed via"]
[18.9564, "o", " spawn"]
[18.9738, "o", "/wait"]
[18.9911, "o", ";"]
[19.0084, "o", " a shell"]
[19.0253, "o", " child"]
[19.0427, "o", " process would"]
[19.0601, "o", " just be"]
[19.077, "o", " an orphan process"]
[19.0945, "o", " inside the shell's cgroup. It"]
[19.112, "o", " would"]
[19.1294, "o", " keep running, but"]
[19.1469, "o", " I"]
[19.1642, "o", " have no way to"]
[19.1817, "o", " wait for it. Maybe"]
[19.1992, "o", " I could support `&`"]
[19.2167, "o", " by"]
[19.2341, "o", " forking"]
[19.2515, "o", " twice"]
[19.2689, "o", " ("]
[19.2862, "o", "detach"]
[19.3036, "o", ")? That"]
[19.3211, "o", " could cause"]
[19.3386, "o", " confusion"]
[19.3559, "o", ". Let's skip"]
[19.3735, "o", " background execution"]
[19.391, "o", " for"]
[19.4084, "o", " v1, but"]
[19.4259, "o", " note that"]
[19.4433, "o", " commands run"]
[19.4607, "o", " in the foreground and the"]
[19.4783, "o", " shell waits for"]
[19.4958, "o", " them.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[19.5133, "o", "Line"]
[19.5307, "o", " editing"]
[19.5481, "o", "?"]
[19.5654, "o", " No"]
[19.5822, "o", " term"]
[19.5995, "o", "ios"]
[19.6169, "o", " setup for"]
[19.6343, "o", " editing;"]
[19.6518, "o", " just read lines with"]
[19.6693, "o", " fgets"]
[19.6867, "o", ". That's"]
[19.7041, "o", " enough"]
[19.7215, "o", " for a text"]
[19.7383, "o", " console."]
[19.7558, "o", " Actually"]
[19.7731, "o", ","]
[19.7905, "o", " in tty mode the console is"]
[19.8075, "o", " passed to the"]
[19.8249, "o", " program; read"]
[19.8424, "o", "("]
[19.8598, "o", "0"]
[19.8771, "o", ")"]
[19.8945, "o", " lines work."]
[19.9114, "o", " Should I"]
[19.9289, "o", " turn off"]
[19.9463, "o", " echo?"]
[19.9637, "o", " The tty"]
[19.9812, "o", " might"]
[19.9986, "o", " be"]
[20.0159, "o", " in"]
[20.0333, "o", " canonical mode with"]
[20.0508, "o", " echo"]
[20.0683, "o", " on, so the"]
[20.0858, "o", " typed"]
[20.1031, "o", " characters"]
[20.1205, "o", " echo"]
[20.1379, "o", " naturally \u2014"]
[20.1553, "o", " good, that's"]
[20.1728, "o", " exactly"]
[20.1901, "o", " what a"]
[20.2076, "o", " shell should"]
[20.2247, "o", " look like.\r\r\n\r\r\nLet"]
[20.2422, "o", " me write the"]
[20.2597, "o", " code:\r\r\n\r\r\n```c\r\r\n#include "]
[20.2772, "o", "<stdio.h>\r\r\n#include <stdlib.h"]
[20.2948, "o", ">\r\r\n#include <string.h>\r\r\n"]
[20.3123, "o", "#include <unistd.h>\r\r\n#include "]
[20.3299, "o", "<fcntl.h>\r\r\n#include <sys"]
[20.3475, "o", "/wait.h>\r\r\n#include "]
[20.365, "o", "<errno.h>\r\r\n\r\r\n#define"]
[20.3825, "o", " PATH"]
[20.3999, "o", "_DIRS"]
[20.4173, "o", " "]
[20.4346, "o", "3\r\r\n"]
[20.452, "o", "static const char *"]
[20.4695, "o", "bin"]
[20.4869, "o", "_dirs"]
[20.5042, "o", "[PATH_DIRS] = {"]
[20.5217, "o", " \"/generated/bin\", \"/bin\", \"/"]
[20.5393, "o", "usr/bin\" };\r\r\n\r\r\nstatic char"]
[20.5569, "o", " line"]
[20.5743, "o", "buf["]
[20.5918, "o", "8192];\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[20.6095, "o", "/*"]
[20.6268, "o", " tokenization"]
[20.6443, "o", " respecting"]
[20.6617, "o", " single"]
[20.6791, "o", " and double quotes */\r\r\nstatic"]
[20.6966, "o", " int"]
[20.7139, "o", " tokenize"]
[20.7313, "o", "(char *buf"]
[20.7488, "o", ", char *out"]
[20.7663, "o", "[][6"]
[20.7837, "o", "4], int"]
[20.8012, "o", " max"]
[20.8186, "o", "tok, int"]
[20.8361, "o", " maxlen)"]
[20.8535, "o", " \r\r\n```\r\r\n\r\r\nHmm,"]
[20.871, "o", " let me"]
[20.8884, "o", " structure it"]
[20.9059, "o", ":"]
[20.9232, "o", " parse the"]
[20.9407, "o", " line into tokens ("]
[20.9582, "o", "max"]
[20.9755, "o", " ~"]
[20.9929, "o", "32 tokens"]
[21.0103, "o", ", each"]
[21.0279, "o", " ~1"]
[21.0453, "o", "024 chars). Handle"]
[21.0629, "o", " quotes"]
[21.0803, "o", ":"]
[21.0976, "o", " inside"]
[21.115, "o", " single quotes"]
[21.1324, "o", " it's literal"]
[21.1499, "o", ";"]
[21.1673, "o", " double quotes"]
[21.1849, "o", " also literal but"]
[21.2024, "o", " allow \""]
[21.2199, "o", "escapes\"? Keep it simple:"]
[21.2374, "o", " both"]
[21.2547, "o", " quote types strip"]
[21.2722, "o", " the quote and keep"]
[21.2898, "o", " the content,"]
[21.3072, "o", " `\"`"]
[21.3247, "o", " also handles backslash escapes"]
[21.3422, "o", "."]
[21.3595, "o", " That's enough.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[21.3771, "o", "Then parse:"]
[21.394, "o", " tokens"]
[21.4113, "o", " until `"]
[21.4288, "o", ">`,"]
[21.4463, "o", " then redirection"]
[21.4631, "o", " target;"]
[21.4806, "o", " or `<`"]
[21.498, "o", " for"]
[21.5154, "o", " input."]
[21.5328, "o", " Only"]
[21.5502, "o", " trailing redirects"]
[21.567, "o", " ("]
[21.5838, "o", "redirect"]
[21.6012, "o", " after"]
[21.618, "o", " command), and"]
[21.6355, "o", " maybe at"]
[21.653, "o", " the beginning"]
[21.6705, "o", " too?"]
[21.6879, "o", " Standard:"]
[21.7054, "o", " redirects"]
[21.7227, "o", " can be anywhere"]
[21.7403, "o", ", but"]
[21.7577, "o", " trailing is"]
[21.7752, "o", " the common case"]
[21.7927, "o", ". Let's support trailing"]
[21.8103, "o", " `>"]
[21.8279, "o", " file`"]
[21.8454, "o", " or `< file`, and"]
[21.8629, "o", " allow"]
[21.8803, "o", " it"]
[21.8977, "o", " to appear after the command ("]
[21.9152, "o", "scanning for"]
[21.9326, "o", " it).\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[21.9501, "o", "Simpler approach:"]
[21.967, "o", " scan all"]
[21.9845, "o", " tokens; if a token is"]
[22.0021, "o", " \">\" or"]
[22.0196, "o", " \""]
[22.037, "o", ">\", the next token is the"]
[22.0546, "o", " redirect target"]
[22.0721, "o", " and"]
[22.0894, "o", " everything after"]
[22.1069, "o", " is ignored (or"]
[22.1244, "o", " also"]
[22.1418, "o", " support multiple redirects?"]
[22.1594, "o", " keep it to one"]
[22.1769, "o", ").\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[22.1944, "o", "Execution:\r\r\n```c\r\r\n"]
[22.2121, "o", "pid_t pid = fork();\r\r\nif"]
[22.2291, "o", " (pid == 0) {\r\r\n"]
[22.2467, "o", "    if (red"]
