[40.1476, "o", " I"]
[40.1651, "o", " get a newline."]
[40.1827, "o", " In raw mode, each read"]
[40.1998, "o", " might"]
[40.2172, "o", " be a"]
[40.2349, "o", " few"]
[40.2524, "o", " characters."]
[40.27, "o", " Either way, the"]
[40.2876, "o", " accumulation"]
[40.3051, "o", " approach works.\r\r\n\r\r\nOne"]
[40.3222, "o", " gotcha"]
[40.3398, "o", " in canonical mode: a"]
[40.3574, "o", " huge line ("]
