[41.27, "o", " lost"]
[41.2875, "o", " (in"]
[41.3051, "o", " canonical mode)."]
[41.3227, "o", " Let me"]
[41.3397, "o", " think"]
[41.3573, "o", "\u2026"]
[41.3748, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nIn"]
[41.3924, "o", " canonical"]
[41.4099, "o", " ("]
[41.4275, "o", "canonical) mode,"]
[41.4451, "o", " when the terminal"]
[41.4627, "o", " receives"]
[41.4802, "o", " IN"]
[41.4977, "o", "TR"]
[41.5152, "o", ", the"]
[41.5328, "o", " driver sends SIGINT"]
[41.5504, "o", " to the foreground pgrp"]
[41.5682, "o", " and"]
[41.5858, "o", " clears the current line"]
[41.6035, "o", " buffer? I think the"]
[41.6211, "o", " line buffer is"]
[41.6381, "o", " preserved (the"]
[41.6552, "o", " user can"]
[41.6727, "o", " retype"]
[41.6903, "o", " or the"]
[41.7073, "o", " next read returns it)."]
[41.7244, "o", " Testing"]
[41.7419, "o", " knowledge: with a"]
[41.7595, "o", " simple C program"]
[41.7771, "o", " using"]
[41.7946, "o", " fgets"]
[41.8122, "o", " in canonical mode, Ctrl+C"]
[41.8298, "o", ":"]
[41.8473, "o", " fgets returns"]
[41.8649, "o", " NULL"]
[41.8824, "o", "? No \u2014"]
[41.9, "o", " it returns a"]
[41.9176, "o", " partial line"]
[41.9353, "o", " without a newline ("]
[41.9529, "o", "fgets"]
[41.9704, "o", " stops when"]
[41.9881, "o", " read is interrupted"]
[42.0057, "o", "? no"]
[42.0232, "o", "\u2026)."]
[42.0407, "o", " Hmm,"]
[42.0583, "o", " actually"]
[42.0758, "o", " read"]
[42.0933, "o", "()"]
[42.1108, "o", " returns -1 EINTR"]
[42.1284, "o", ","]
[42.1458, "o", " and fgets"]
[42.1635, "o", " on -1 with"]
[42.1812, "o", " nothing read returns NULL."]
[42.1989, "o", " The partial line"]
[42.2165, "o", " remains in the tty"]
[42.2342, "o", " buffer, so the next"]
[42.2518, "o", " fgets returns it."]
[42.2689, "o", " I think"]
[42.2865, "o", " that's"]
[42.3041, "o", " right \u2014 the"]
[42.3217, "o", " canonical line buffer"]
[42.3393, "o", " isn't cleared"]
[42.3569, "o", " on"]
[42.3744, "o", " EINTR.\r\r\n\r\r\nIn my"]
[42.392, "o", " accumulation loop: read"]
[42.4096, "o", " returns -1 EINTR;"]
[42.4273, "o", " my code `continue"]
[42.4449, "o", "`s and reads"]
[42.4625, "o", " again"]
[42.4801, "o", " \u2014 the next read returns the partial line"]
[42.4978, "o", ", and"]
[42.5154, "o", " I append it to the line"]
[42.533, "o", " already"]
[42.5505, "o", " accumulated (which"]
[42.5682, "o", " was"]
[42.5857, "o", " the same"]
[42.6033, "o", " bytes"]
[42.6208, "o", ", since"]
[42.6385, "o", " canonical mode"]
[42.6556, "o", " delivers"]
[42.6732, "o", " the whole line"]
[42.6908, "o", " buffer at once"]
[42.7079, "o", ")!"]
[42.7253, "o", " Risk of duplication"]
[42.7429, "o", ":"]
[42.7604, "o", " the first read"]
[42.778, "o", " already returned the partial line"]
[42.7956, "o", " before EINTR"]
[42.8132, "o", "?"]
[42.8307, "o", " No \u2014 EINTR"]
[42.8483, "o", " means"]
[42.8657, "o", " nothing was read (read"]
[42.8828, "o", " returns -1"]
[42.9004, "o", ", 0 bytes). So"]
[42.9181, "o", " no duplication"]
[42.9357, "o", ": the first read returns"]
[42.9533, "o", " nothing"]
[42.9708, "o", ", and the"]
[42.9884, "o", " next read returns the partial line. Good"]
[43.0061, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\nBut"]
[43.0237, "o", ": in"]
[43.0413, "o", " canonical mode, a"]
[43.0589, "o", " partial line"]
[43.0765, "o", " (no newline)"]
[43.0942, "o", " \u2014"]
[43.1117, "o", " my"]
[43.1292, "o", " loop"]
[43.1467, "o", " keeps"]
[43.1642, "o", " waiting"]
[43.1818, "o", " for a newline. If the user"]
[43.1995, "o", " hit Ctrl+C,"]
[43.2171, "o", " they're probably"]
[43.2347, "o", " expecting a"]
[43.2523, "o", " new prompt and"]
[43.2699, "o", " to"]
[43.2874, "o", " retype. The"]
[43.3051, "o", " old partial"]
[43.3227, "o", " text"]
[43.3402, "o", " remains in the buffer"]
[43.3578, "o", ", and the next read"]
[43.3754, "o", " returns it \u2014"]
[43.393, "o", " I"]
[43.4106, "o", " treat it as a"]
[43.4282, "o", " line"]
[43.4457, "o", " only when"]
[43.4633, "o", " I see a newline\u2026 if the user"]
[43.481, "o", " types"]
[43.4984, "o", " more"]
[43.5159, "o", ", it"]
[43.5335, "o", " appends"]
[43.5511, "o", " to the old partial line \u2014"]
[43.5688, "o", " confusing, but that's actually the"]
[43.5865, "o", " standard"]
[43.604, "o", " canonical-mode behavior (the"]
[43.6217, "o", " line is preserved)."]
[43.6393, "o", " bash does"]
[43.657, "o", " line"]
[43.6746, "o", " discipline"]
[43.6921, "o", " handling"]
[43.7097, "o", " to"]
[43.7273, "o", " clear"]
[43.7449, "o", " it, but"]
[43.7625, "o", " let's"]
[43.7802, "o", " not"]
[43.7976, "o", " over-engineer. Actually,"]
[43.8153, "o", " for safety,"]
[43.8329, "o", " on EINTR"]
[43.8505, "o", ": discard"]
[43.8681, "o", " what"]
[43.8857, "o", " I've"]
[43.9033, "o", " accumulated so far"]
[43.9209, "o", " in this"]
[43.9385, "o", " line?"]
[43.9556, "o", " Nothing is accumulated"]
[43.9726, "o", " ("]
[43.9901, "o", "0 bytes)"]
[44.0077, "o", " in canonical mode,"]
[44.0254, "o", " since"]
[44.0428, "o", " EINTR"]
[44.0604, "o", " returns"]
[44.0779, "o", " nothing. In"]
[44.0956, "o", " raw mode, EINTR returns"]
[44.1132, "o", " after"]
[44.1307, "o", " some"]
[44.1482, "o", " bytes have been read"]
[44.1659, "o", ". In that case"]
[44.1836, "o", ", the"]
[44.2012, "o", " user"]
[44.2188, "o", " sees"]
[44.2363, "o", " the echo"]
[44.2539, "o", " of the"]
[44.2716, "o", " partial line ("]
[44.2886, "o", "raw mode"]
[44.3062, "o", " has no"]
[44.324, "o", " auto"]
[44.3416, "o", "-echo"]
[44.3593, "o", ";"]
[44.3769, "o", " if I"]
[44.3946, "o", " enable"]
[44.4121, "o", " ECHO"]
[44.4291, "o", " in"]
[44.4466, "o", " raw"]
[44.4641, "o", " mode, the"]
[44.4818, "o", " tty echoes"]
[44.4993, "o", " input), and the"]
[44.517, "o", " next read"]
[44.5346, "o", "\u2026"]
[44.5521, "o", " the raw"]
[44.5697, "o", "-mode line buffer is gone"]
[44.5874, "o", " (no"]
[44.605, "o", " canonical"]
[44.6226, "o", " accumulation), so I should discard"]
[44.6397, "o", " my"]
[44.6572, "o", " buffer"]
[44.6747, "o", " on EINTR and reprint"]
[44.6923, "o", " the prompt. Let me handle"]
[44.71, "o", " it"]
[44.7276, "o", " this way: on EINTR,"]
[44.7453, "o", " if I've accumulated"]
[44.7629, "o", " bytes ("]
[44.78, "o", "raw mode), discard them"]
[44.7976, "o", ","]
[44.8152, "o", " break"]
[44.8326, "o", " out"]
[44.8502, "o", " and reprint"]
[44.8678, "o", " the prompt."]
[44.8854, "o", " If I haven't accumulated"]
[44.9031, "o", " anything (canonical mode), just continue the"]
[44.9208, "o", " loop to"]
[44.9385, "o", " get the"]
[44.9562, "o", " preserved partial line"]
[44.9737, "o", "? Hmm, in that"]
[44.9913, "o", " case, the"]
[45.009, "o", " prompt is printed"]
[45.0266, "o", " before the"]
[45.0442, "o", " rest of the partial line \u2014 the"]
[45.0618, "o", " display shows the prompt"]
[45.0795, "o", " and"]
[45.097, "o", " then"]
[45.1145, "o", " the"]
[45.1321, "o", " user's old text \u2014"]
[45.1497, "o", " which is actually fine,"]
[45.1668, "o", " looks like"]
[45.1844, "o", " a"]
[45.2019, "o", " preserved line.\r\r\n\r\r\nThis is getting"]
[45.2196, "o", " too deep."]
[45.2372, "o", " Practical"]
[45.2547, "o", " call: don't"]
[45.2723, "o", " touch termios"]
[45.29, "o", " (leave the tty"]
[45.3077, "o", " as"]
[45.3252, "o", " the spawn"]
[45.3429, "o", " wrapper"]
[45.3604, "o", " configured it \u2014 probably"]
[45.3775, "o", " canonical mode with"]
[45.3951, "o", " echo)."]
[45.4128, "o", " Use the accumulation"]
[45.4304, "o", " read loop; on E"]
[45.4481, "o", "INTR, discard the"]
[45.4657, "o", " accumulation and"]
[45.4833, "o", " break"]
[45.5008, "o", " to the prompt"]
[45.5185, "o", " loop ("]
[45.5361, "o", "reprint the prompt)."]
[45.5537, "o", " In canonical mode, the"]
[45.5714, "o", " preserved partial line"]
[45.5891, "o", " comes back"]
[45.6067, "o", " on the next read"]
[45.6067, "o", " \u2014 the user"]
[45.6244, "o", " sees"]
[45.642, "o", " `"]
[45.6595, "o", "potemkin>"]
[45.6772, "o", " partial` and"]
[45.6948, "o", " can continue typing or"]
[45.7124, "o", " hit Enter. That's"]
[45.7301, "o", " acceptable,"]
[45.7477, "o", " standard"]
[45.7652, "o", "-ish behavior.\r\r\n\r\r\nWait,"]
[45.7829, "o", " one"]
[45.7998, "o", " more"]
[45.8174, "o", " point: in canonical mode, if the"]
[45.8351, "o", " user hits Ctrl+C"]
[45.8528, "o", " on"]
[45.8704, "o", " an empty line,"]
[45.8881, "o", " EINTR"]
[45.9057, "o", ","]
[45.9232, "o", " reprint the prompt."]
[45.9409, "o", " Good.\r\r\n\r\r\nOK"]
[45.9585, "o", "."]
[45.9761, "o", " Also"]
[45.9936, "o", " handle SIGINT"]
[46.0112, "o", " in the child: the child inherits the"]
[46.029, "o", " default"]
[46.0465, "o", " disposition"]
[46.064, "o", " (SIGINT"]
[46.0817, "o", " kills the child) \u2014"]
[46.0993, "o", " since"]
[46.1168, "o", " I"]
[46.1342, "o", " don't set"]
[46.1513, "o", " handlers in the"]
[46.1683, "o", " shell"]
[46.1858, "o", ", the child"]
[46.2035, "o", " gets the default."]
[46.2211, "o", " The shell itself"]
[46.2387, "o", " also"]
[46.2562, "o", " receives"]
[46.2737, "o", " SIGINT ("]
[46.2913, "o", "same pgrp)"]
[46.3089, "o", " \u2192"]
[46.3264, "o", " read"]
[46.344, "o", " EINTR \u2192 loop"]
[46.3611, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\nNow,"]
[46.3787, "o", " also"]
[46.3962, "o", " print a"]
[46.4138, "o", " small \""]
[46.4315, "o", "job ended\""]
[46.4492, "o", " status? No"]
[46.4669, "o", ", keep it simple.\r\r\n\r\r\nAlso"]
[46.4846, "o", ": `"]
[46.5022, "o", "history`"]
[46.5198, "o", "? Skip.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[46.5374, "o", "`"]
[46.5549, "o", "man`?"]
[46.5725, "o", " Doesn't exist.\r\r\n\r\r\nLet me"]
[46.5902, "o", " also"]
[46.6077, "o", " make `help`"]
[46.6254, "o", " print"]
[46.6429, "o", " a good"]
[46.6604, "o", " overview:\r\r\n```\r\r\n"]
[46.6781, "o", "Builtins:\r\r\n "]
[46.6957, "o", " help"]
[46.7132, "o", "           "]
[46.7308, "o", " this message\r\r\n "]
[46.7484, "o", " echo"]
