[47.2912, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[47.309, "o", "Name"]
[47.3266, "o", " the"]
[47.344, "o", " binary"]
[47.3615, "o", " `sh`.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[47.3791, "o", "Also"]
[47.3967, "o", ", let me"]
[47.4143, "o", " think about whether the"]
[47.4319, "o", " child"]
[47.4494, "o", "'s execv"]
[47.4672, "o", " inherits the"]
[47.4848, "o", " environment \u2014 yes"]
[47.5025, "o", ", and"]
[47.5201, "o", " I set PATH and"]
[47.5378, "o", " HOME in main"]
[47.5554, "o", " before"]
[47.5729, "o", " the loop.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[47.5906, "o", "Potential issue: the shell's"]
[47.6083, "o", " cgroup"]
[47.6259, "o", " memory cap is"]
[47.6435, "o", " default 512"]
[47.6612, "o", "MB \u2014 fine.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[47.6788, "o", "Another"]
[47.6963, "o", " consideration:"]
[47.7139, "o", " when the shell"]
[47.7315, "o", "'s child exec"]
[47.7492, "o", "s"]
[47.7666, "o", " a program ("]
[47.7843, "o", "ls), that program's output"]
[47.802, "o", " goes to the tty \u2014 the"]
[47.8197, "o", " user"]
[47.8372, "o", " sees it."]
[47.8549, "o", " After"]
[47.8724, "o", " the child exits,"]
[47.89, "o", " waitpid"]
[47.9071, "o", " re"]
[47.9245, "o", "aps it"]
[47.9422, "o", ". No"]
[47.9598, "o", " zombies.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[47.9774, "o", "Signals"]
[47.9951, "o", " to the"]
[48.0128, "o", " shell from"]
[48.0299, "o", " my `wait"]
[48.0476, "o", "` tool?"]
[48.0653, "o", " If the user"]
[48.0829, "o", " wants"]
[48.1004, "o", ", I can send"]
[48.118, "o", " signals to the"]
[48.1357, "o", " shell"]
[48.1532, "o", "'s pid later via the"]
[48.1709, "o", " wait tool. Not"]
[48.1885, "o", " needed now.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[48.2062, "o", "Let me write the"]
[48.2239, "o", " final code:\r\r\n\r\r\n```"]
