[72.4341, "o", " (empty line,"]
[72.4513, "o", " just"]
[72.4684, "o", " reprint"]
[72.4855, "o", " the prompt). If I"]
[72.5027, "o", " haven't"]
[72.5198, "o", " accumulated anything (canonical mode),"]
[72.5371, "o", " the"]
[72.5542, "o", " partial line"]
[72.5713, "o", " remains in the tty"]
[72.5885, "o", " buffer"]
[72.6056, "o", " \u2192 the"]
[72.6228, "o", " next read_line returns it."]
[72.6401, "o", " Both"]
[72.6572, "o", " are"]
[72.6742, "o", " OK"]
[72.6912, "o", " with linebuf[0]=0"]
[72.7085, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[72.7258, "o", "But"]
[72.7428, "o", " hmm, in canonical mode,"]
