[241.1812, "o", "io"]
[241.1991, "o", " buffer was"]
[241.2171, "o", " never flushed?"]
[241.2352, "o", " exit() flushes"]
[241.2533, "o", " stdio... unless the"]
[241.2714, "o", " buffer was already"]
[241.2894, "o", "... hmm.\r\r\n\r\r\nWait"]
[241.3075, "o", "."]
[241.3254, "o", " Oh"]
[241.3433, "o", ". Oh,"]
[241.3614, "o", " wait. I think I"]
[241.3795, "o", " finally get it"]
[241.3977, "o", "!!!\r\r\n\r\r\nThe parent's stdio"]
[241.4158, "o", " buffer"]
[241.4337, "o", " is"]
[241.4516, "o", " inherited by"]
[241.4696, "o", " all"]
[241.4875, "o", " forked children"]
[241.5055, "o", " as a copy. When"]
[241.5236, "o", " a child"]
[241.5416, "o", " writes to stdout and exits ("]
[241.5597, "o", "flushes), it"]
[241.5778, "o", " writes from its own buffer"]
[241.5958, "o", " copy"]
[241.6137, "o", ". That's"]
[241.6318, "o", " fine"]
