[267.1409, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nWhat if the harness's"]
[267.1409, "o", " capture"]
[267.1591, "o", " = a"]
[267.1772, "o", " pty"]
[267.1954, "o", ", and when the"]
[267.2136, "o", " head child"]
[267.2317, "o", " (the"]
[267.2499, "o", " last"]
[267.2679, "o", " writer"]
[267.2859, "o", " in"]
[267.304, "o", " the pipeline) exits"]
[267.3221, "o", ","]
[267.3402, "o", " something"]
[267.3583, "o", " resets the pty?"]
[267.3765, "o", " Like,"]
[267.3946, "o", " if the"]
[267.4128, "o", " harness allocates the pty"]
[267.431, "o", " per"]
[267.4491, "o", " process"]
[267.4671, "o", " in the c"]
[267.4853, "o", "group"]
[267.5033, "o", ", and"]
[267.5215, "o", " when a"]
[267.5398, "o", " process exits"]
[267.5579, "o", " the pty is..."]
[267.5762, "o", "?"]
[267.5942, "o", " \""]
[267.6123, "o", "tty mode"]
[267.6304, "o", " hands the console to the"]
[267.6486, "o", " program\" \u2014"]
[267.6669, "o", " the"]
[267.6849, "o", " console"]
[267.703, "o", "/pty is per"]
[267.7212, "o", " spawned process! If capture"]
[267.7394, "o", " mode also"]
[267.7577, "o", " gives each"]
[267.7758, "o", " program its own pty"]
[267.794, "o", " ("]
[267.812, "o", "for the \""]
[267.8302, "o", "output\" capture),"]
[267.8484, "o", " and"]
[267.8664, "o", " the pty is"]
[267.8846, "o", " tied to the"]
[267.9028, "o", " cgroup's"]
[267.921, "o", " foreground process... when"]
[267.9391, "o", " head exits, the pty"]
[267.9573, "o", " might be"]
[267.9755, "o", " torn"]
[267.9935, "o", " down /"]
[268.0117, "o", " reassigned, and"]
[268.0299, "o", " subsequent writes ("]
[268.0481, "o", "from the pwd child"]
[268.0663, "o", " in the same cgroup) go to"]
[268.0845, "o", " a dead pty \u2192 lost!\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[268.1027, "o", "And in test 1,"]
[268.1209, "o", " no intermediate"]
[268.139, "o", " child"]
[268.1571, "o", " \u2192 the pwd child writes"]
[268.1753, "o", " while the shell"]
[268.1936, "o", " still \"owns\" the pty \u2192"]
[268.2119, "o", " captured.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[268.23, "o", "Hmm,"]
[268.2482, "o", " this is"]
[268.2664, "o", " plausible"]
[268.2843, "o", ", but I"]
[268.3025, "o", " can't verify the harness"]
[268.3207, "o", " internals from"]
[268.3389, "o", " inside..."]
[268.3571, "o", " actually, I can verify from"]
[268.3753, "o", " inside: read"]
[268.3935, "o", " /proc/self/fd/1"]
[268.4117, "o", " from the parent"]
[268.4299, "o", " and the"]
[268.4481, "o", " child, and"]
[268.4663, "o", " check whether the"]
[268.4845, "o", " target"]
[268.5025, "o", " changes. If"]
[268.5207, "o", " fd 1"]
[268.5388, "o", " in the parent"]
[268.557, "o", " after the pipeline"]
[268.5752, "o", " points to a"]
[268.5933, "o", " different /"]
[268.6115, "o", "dev"]
[268.6295, "o", "/pt"]
[268.6477, "o", "mx"]
[268.6657, "o", " instance"]
[268.6838, "o", " (or a"]
[268.702, "o", " broken pipe),"]
[268.7203, "o", " that"]
[268.7384, "o", " would confirm it"]
[268.7566, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\nLet me"]
[268.7748, "o", " build"]
[268.7928, "o", " sh_dbg with"]
[268.811, "o", " readlink traces"]
[268.8291, "o", " on"]
[268.8472, "o", " fd "]
[268.8654, "o", "0/1/2"]
[268.8835, "o", ":\r\r\n-"]
[268.9017, "o", " at"]
[268.9198, "o", " startup (parent)\r\r\n-"]
[268.938, "o", " in child"]
[268.9561, "o", "_run"]
[268.9741, "o", " ("]
[268.9921, "o", "each child)\r\r\n-"]
[269.0104, "o", " in the parent after the pipeline ("]
[269.0286, "o", "after"]
[269.0466, "o", " the waitpid)"]
[269.0648, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nAnd"]
[269.083, "o", " to"]
[269.1011, "o", " make the"]
[269.1193, "o", " comparison"]
[269.1373, "o", " clear,"]
[269.1555, "o", " print the fd"]
[269.1737, "o", " numbers"]
[269.1917, "o", " of"]
[269.2098, "o", " the"]
[269.2278, "o", " capture"]
[269.2458, "o", " too:"]
[269.264, "o", " also list the"]
[269.2821, "o", " fds"]
[269.3002, "o", " open"]
[269.3182, "o", " in"]
[269.3362, "o", " /proc/self/fd"]
[269.3545, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[269.3728, "o", "Let me write it.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[269.391, "o", "Actually, one more"]
[269.4092, "o", " quick"]
[269.4272, "o", " thing to check"]
[269.4455, "o", " first: /proc"]
[269.4637, "o", "/self/fd in"]
[269.4818, "o", " this"]
[269.4998, "o", " environment \u2014"]
[269.518, "o", " does"]
[269.5361, "o", " it work? /proc"]
[269.5544, "o", " exists in the"]
[269.5725, "o", " root listing. Let me"]
[269.5907, "o", " just"]
[269.6088, "o", " build the"]
[269.6269, "o", " debug"]
[269.645, "o", " shell and"]
[269.6631, "o", " run"]
[269.6811, "o", " test 3;"]
[269.6994, "o", " if"]
[269.7174, "o", " /proc"]
[269.7355, "o", "/self/fd"]
[269.7538, "o", " doesn't work,"]
[269.772, "o", " readlink will"]
[269.7902, "o", " fail and I'll"]
[269.8084, "o", " see"]
[269.8265, "o", " \"?\".\r\r\n\r\r\nPlan:"]
[269.8447, "o", "\r\r\n1."]
[269.8629, "o", " Build sh_dbg"]
[269.881, "o", " = sh with"]
[269.8994, "o", " traces added.\r\r\n2. Run test"]
[269.9177, "o", " 3 against sh_dbg.\r\r\n3"]
[269.9359, "o", ". Analyze"]
[269.9541, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[269.9723, "o", "Traces"]
[269.9904, "o", " ("]
[270.0085, "o", "all to stderr, unbuffered,"]
[270.0267, "o", " so they"]
[270.0449, "o", " reliably"]
[270.0629, "o", " get captured"]
[270.0811, "o", " \u2014"]
[270.0991, "o", " v1"]
[270.1172, "o", " proved"]
[270.1353, "o", " that stderr"]
[270.1535, "o", " from"]
[270.1716, "o", " a child is captured):"]
[270.1898, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nParent"]
[270.2079, "o", " startup:\r\r\n```c\r\r\n"]
[270.2262, "o", "trace"]
[270.2442, "o", "(\"parent"]
[270.2624, "o", " start\");\r\r\n```\r\r\n"]
[270.2806, "o", "where trace"]
[270.2988, "o", " prints"]
[270.3168, "o", ": pid, read"]
[270.3349, "o", "link of fd 0"]
[270.3532, "o", ", 1, 2"]
[270.3714, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[270.3897, "o", "```c\r\r\nstatic"]
[270.408, "o", " void"]
[270.4261, "o", " fd_trace(const char *"]
[270.4443, "o", "who)\r\r\n{\r\r\n   "]
[270.4626, "o", " char b"]
[270.4808, "o", "0["]
[270.4989, "o", "128], b1[1"]
[270.5172, "o", "28], b2[12"]
[270.5355, "o", "8];\r\r\n    ssize_t l"]
[270.5538, "o", ";\r\r\n    l = readlink(\"/"]
[270.572, "o", "proc/self/fd/0\", b"]
[270.5903, "o", "0, sizeof b0 - 1"]
[270.6086, "o", "); if (l > 0)"]
[270.6269, "o", " b0[l] = 0;"]
[270.6452, "o", " else"]
[270.6634, "o", " { b0[0] ="]
[270.6818, "o", " '?'; b0[1] ="]
[270.7001, "o", " 0; }\r\r\n    l ="]
[270.7184, "o", " readlink(\"/proc/self/fd/"]
[270.7367, "o", "1\", b1, sizeof b1"]
[270.755, "o", " - 1); if (l >"]
[270.7733, "o", " 0) b1[l] ="]
[270.7917, "o", " 0; else { b1["]
[270.81, "o", "0] = '?'; b1["]
[270.8283, "o", "1] = 0; }\r\r\n"]
[270.8466, "o", "    l = readlink(\"/proc/self"]
[270.8649, "o", "/fd/2\", b2,"]
[270.8832, "o", " sizeof b2 - 1); if"]
[270.9015, "o", " (l > 0) b2"]
[270.9198, "o", "[l] = 0; else {"]
[270.9381, "o", " b2[0] = '?';"]
[270.9564, "o", " b2[1] = 0"]
[270.9747, "o", "; }\r\r\n    fprintf(stderr, \""]
[270.993, "o", "DBG"]
[271.0111, "o", " %s (pid"]
[271.0293, "o", " %d"]
[271.0475, "o", "): fd0"]
[271.0656, "o", "=%s fd1=%s fd2"]
[271.084, "o", "=%s\\n\", who, ("]
[271.1023, "o", "int"]
[271.1203, "o", ")getpid(), b0, b1"]
[271.1387, "o", ", b2);\r\r\n}\r\r\n```"]
[271.157, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nCall"]
[271.1752, "o", " sites:\r\r\n-"]
[271.1934, "o", " main:"]
[271.2115, "o", " fd_trace(\"parent"]
[271.2297, "o", "-start\")\r\r\n-"]
[271.2479, "o", " run_pipeline:"]
[271.2662, "o", " before"]
[271.2842, "o", " the fork"]
[271.3024, "o", " for each stage ("]
[271.3206, "o", "parent)"]
[271.3388, "o", " fd_trace(\"parent"]
[271.3571, "o", "-pre"]
[271.3751, "o", "-fork"]
[271.3933, "o", "-s"]
[271.4114, "o", "%d\"); after the waitpid"]
[271.4296, "o", " loop fd_trace(\"parent"]
[271.4478, "o", "-post-pipeline\")\r\r\n- child_run"]
[271.466, "o", ": fd_trace(\"child"]
[271.4842, "o", "-"]
[271.5025, "o", "<cmd"]
[271.5205, "o", ">\")\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[271.5387, "o", "Then run"]
[271.5568, "o", ":\r\r\n```\r\r\n"]
[271.5751, "o", "cat /"]
[271.5934, "o", "data/read"]
[271.6117, "o", "me.txt | head"]
[271.6299, "o", " -1\r\r\npwd\r\r\n"]
[271.648, "o", "exit\r\r\n```\r\r\n\r\r\nCompare"]
[271.6663, "o", " the fd1"]
[271.6844, "o", " values:"]
[271.7026, "o", " if"]
[271.7207, "o", " the parent's fd1 after the pipeline"]
[271.739, "o", " differs from the"]
[271.7572, "o", " fd1"]
[271.7754, "o", " the pwd child"]
[271.7936, "o", " sees"]
[271.8118, "o", "..."]
[271.8298, "o", " etc."]
[271.848, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[271.866, "o", "Let me write this"]
[271.8842, "o", " as"]
[271.9023, "o", " a"]
[271.9203, "o", " modification"]
[271.9384, "o", " of the"]
[271.9566, "o", " sh source ("]
[271.9747, "o", "same"]
[271.9928, "o", " name sh_dbg"]
[272.0109, "o", "). The full"]
[272.0291, "o", " source"]
[272.0472, "o", " +"]
[272.0653, "o", " 4 lines of"]
[272.0835, "o", " trace calls +"]
[272.1016, "o", " the fd_trace function.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[272.1199, "o", "One"]
[272.138, "o", " risk:"]
[272.1562, "o", " if /proc/self/fd doesn't"]
[272.1746, "o", " exist in this sandbox,"]
[272.1928, "o", " readlink will fail"]
[272.2111, "o", " \u2192 \"?\""]
[272.2292, "o", " \u2014"]
[272.2473, "o", " in that case"]
[272.2655, "o", ","]
[272.2835, "o", " a different approach:"]
[272.3017, "o", " fstat"]
[272.3199, "o", " fd 1 and"]
[272.3381, "o", " print the r"]
[272.3564, "o", "dev"]
[272.3745, "o", "/inode... /"]
[272.3926, "o", "proc's"]
[272.4108, "o", " stat"]
[272.4289, "o", " needs /"]
[272.4471, "o", "proc."]
[272.4654, "o", " Or the"]
[272.4835, "o", " read"]
[272.5016, "o", "() trick: if"]
[272.52, "o", " fd"]
[272.538, "o", "1 is a pipe"]
[272.5562, "o", ", read"]
[272.5744, "o", "link will"]
[272.5926, "o", " show"]
[272.6107, "o", " \"pipe:["]
[272.6289, "o", "inode"]
[272.647, "o", "]\" \u2014"]
[272.6652, "o", " if /proc"]
[272.6833, "o", " works."]
[272.7015, "o", " Let's"]
[272.7198, "o", " just try"]
[272.7379, "o", " it.\r\r\n"]
[272.738, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[272.7562, "o", "`"]
[272.7743, "o", "cd`"]
[272.7926, "o", "+`pwd` works"]
[272.8109, "o", " on its own"]
[272.8292, "o", ", and"]
[272.8473, "o", " a"]
[272.8654, "o", " standalone `pwd`"]
[272.8836, "o", " works too, but"]
[272.9018, "o", " `pwd` after a pipeline"]
[272.92, "o", " loses its output."]
[272.9382, "o", " Something"]
[272.9563, "o", " in the pipeline"]
[272.9745, "o", " handling is"]
[272.9927, "o", " breaking the fd"]
[273.0108, "o", "/stdio state of"]
[273.0291, "o", " subsequent child processes."]
[273.0473, "o", " Adding"]
[273.0653, "o", " fd tracing to the debug"]
[273.0836, "o", " build"]
[273.1016, "o", " to"]
[273.1197, "o", " check where"]
[273.1379, "o", " stdout is"]
[273.1561, "o", " pointing:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[283.4618, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  compile sh_dbg.c\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[283.5372, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0 sha256:ee59f10ab99e0c2c1d6a3a21891a3035697f0a10bea6086be64a0269fecb21e5\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[287.5059, "o", "\u001b[2mNext, I'll run the"]
[287.5241, "o", " failing test"]
[287.5424, "o", " against sh_dbg"]
[287.5607, "o", ":\r\r\n"]
[287.579, "o", "```\r\r\ncat /"]
[287.5973, "o", "data"]
[287.6155, "o", "/readme.txt | head"]
[287.6339, "o", " -1\r\r\npwd\r\r\n"]
[287.6523, "o", "exit\r\r\n```\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[287.7815, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/sh_dbg\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[287.8609, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[288.0991, "o", "\u001b[2mInteresting! The"]
[288.1174, "o", " trace shows:\r\r\n-"]
[288.1356, "o", " All the"]
[288.1539, "o", " fd0"]
[288.1722, "o", "/fd1/fd2 are `"]
[288.1906, "o", "pipe:[2"]
[288.2089, "o", "...`"]
[288.2271, "o", " (the"]
[288.2454, "o", " output is"]
[288.2637, "o", " cut off mid"]
[288.2819, "o", "-inode \u2014"]
[288.3002, "o", " is"]
[288.3184, "o", " the harness's"]
[288.3367, "o", " display truncating the"]
[288.355, "o", " line after \"pipe:[2"]
[288.3734, "o", "\"? Actually"]
[288.3917, "o", " it's"]
[288.4101, "o", " shown as \"fd0"]
[288.4284, "o", "=pipe:[2\" \u2014 the"]
[288.4467, "o", " rest of the line is"]
[288.465, "o", " missing"]
[288.4832, "o", "!"]
[288.5014, "o", " The"]
[288.5196, "o", " DBG line is"]
[288.5379, "o", " getting truncated at \""]
[288.5561, "o", "pipe:[2\""]
[288.5746, "o", " \u2014"]
[288.5927, "o", " probably the"]
[288.611, "o", " harness's output"]
[288.6292, "o", " capture is"]
[288.6475, "o", " mangling"]
[288.6658, "o", "/truncating"]
[288.6841, "o", " lines that contain"]
[288.7024, "o", " certain"]
[288.7206, "o", " byte sequences"]
[288.7388, "o", ". \"pipe:["]
[288.7571, "o", "12345"]
[288.7754, "o", "]\""]
[288.7936, "o", " \u2014 hmm, the"]
[288.8119, "o", " line ends"]
[288.8302, "o", " at \"pipe:[2\". So the"]
[288.8486, "o", " inode"]
[288.8667, "o", " starts with"]
[288.885, "o", " 2,"]
[288.9033, "o", " e.g."]
[288.9216, "o", " pipe:[2014"]
[288.94, "o", "4"]
[288.9581, "o", "5363"]
[288.9764, "o", "7], and the"]
[288.9947, "o", " capture is"]
[289.0131, "o", " dropping"]
[289.0312, "o", " everything after the \"2"]
[289.0495, "o", "\"?? Or"]
[289.0678, "o", " maybe the readlink"]
[289.0861, "o", " result is being"]
[289.1044, "o", " displayed, and the"]
[289.1227, "o", " harness is"]
[289.141, "o", " truncating"]
[289.1593, "o", " at"]
[289.1775, "o", " some"]
[289.1957, "o", " character.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[289.2139, "o", "More importantly"]
[289.2322, "o", ": the"]
[289.2505, "o", " trace for"]
[289.2688, "o", " the `pwd` child"]
[289.2871, "o", " process is missing"]
[289.3054, "o", "!"]
[289.3236, "o", " After \"parent-post-pipeline\""]
[289.3419, "o", " there's"]
[289.3602, "o", " nothing \u2014 the"]
[289.3785, "o", " pwd child process"]
[289.3968, "o", " never"]
[289.415, "o", " once emitted its"]
[289.4333, "o", " \"DBG"]
[289.4516, "o", " pwd s"]
[289.4701, "o", "...\" trace line"]
[289.4884, "o", "!!"]
[289.5067, "o", " But"]
[289.525, "o", " in the earlier"]
[289.5433, "o", " non-debug"]
[289.5616, "o", " run, the"]
[289.5799, "o", " shell's exit"]
[289.5982, "o", " code was 0 and"]
[289.6165, "o", " it clearly processed"]
[289.6348, "o", " the 'exit' line...\r\r\n\r\r\nWait"]
[289.6532, "o", " \u2014 if the pwd"]
[289.6715, "o", " child process"]
[289.6898, "o", " had"]
[289.7079, "o", " run, its fd_trace"]
[289.7262, "o", " (at the"]
[289.7445, "o", " very top of child_run"]
[289.7628, "o", ", before"]
[289.7811, "o", " anything"]
[289.7993, "o", " else) should have"]
[289.8176, "o", " printed to"]
[289.8359, "o", " stderr before"]
[289.8542, "o", " doing get"]
[289.8725, "o", "cwd. There's"]
[289.8908, "o", " no such line. So the pwd child"]
[289.9092, "o", " process never ran"]
[289.9275, "o", " child_run!\r\r\n\r\r\nBut the"]
[289.9459, "o", " shell's exit code"]
[289.9643, "o", " was 0, and the"]
[289.9826, "o", " input"]
[290.0008, "o", " ended with 'exit' \u2014 meaning the"]
[290.0192, "o", " shell"]
[290.0373, "o", " read"]
[290.0555, "o", " \"pwd\" and"]
[290.0737, "o", " \"exit"]
[290.092, "o", "\"... or"]
[290.1102, "o", " did it"]
[290.1285, "o", " really"]
[290.1467, "o", " read them? If the"]
[290.165, "o", " shell's"]
[290.1833, "o", " stdin"]
[290.2014, "o", " had"]
[290.2196, "o", " received"]
[290.2378, "o", " EOF"]
[290.2559, "o", " right after"]
[290.2742, "o", " the pipeline line,"]
[290.2925, "o", " the shell would"]
