[332.5716, "o", " But the probe \u2014"]
[332.5902, "o", " with the same"]
[332.6088, "o", " read pattern \u2014"]
[332.6273, "o", " kept"]
[332.6456, "o", " receiving lines. What's"]
[332.6642, "o", " different between"]
[332.6827, "o", " probe and my shell?\r\r\n\r\r\nDifferences"]
[332.7012, "o", ":\r\r\n1. Probe:"]
[332.7197, "o", " one fork"]
[332.7382, "o", "/wait per line ("]
