[345.6583, "o", " grandchildren"]
[345.6767, "o", "'s)!\r\r\n\r\r\nIf the harness's"]
[345.6954, "o", " input"]
[345.7138, "o", " protocol is:"]
[345.7324, "o", " \""]
[345.751, "o", "after"]
[345.7695, "o", " writing a line, read the"]
