[439.9107, "o", " a helper (no exec) that runs"]
[439.9298, "o", " the stages.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[439.9488, "o", "So the design:\r\r\n- Single command"]
[439.9677, "o", " (no"]
[439.9866, "o", " |):"]
[440.0056, "o", " fork"]
[440.0243, "o", "; the child execs"]
[440.0432, "o", " ("]
[440.0619, "o", "or runs the builtin) \u2014"]
[440.0809, "o", " status quo"]
[440.0997, "o", ", proven"]
[440.1186, "o", " safe.\r\r\n- Pipeline"]
[440.1375, "o", " ("]
[440.1562, "o", "has |): fork"]
[440.1752, "o", " a helper"]
[440.1941, "o", " child (fork"]
[440.2129, "o", " only"]
[440.2317, "o", " \u2014"]
[440.2504, "o", " runs the pipeline"]
[440.2693, "o", " code in"]
[440.2882, "o", "-process,"]
[440.3071, "o", " image stays \"sh\","]
[440.326, "o", " cmdline stays \"sh\"); the helper forks"]
[440.3449, "o", " the stages (the"]
[440.3638, "o", " stages exec"]
[440.3827, "o", " \u2014"]
[440.4015, "o", " but they're"]
[440.4204, "o", " the helper's children,"]
[440.4394, "o", " i.e., grandchildren"]
[440.4583, "o", " of the shell"]
[440.4772, "o", " \u2014 invisible if"]
[440.4961, "o", " the watcher only watches direct children); the"]
[440.5152, "o", " helper waits"]
[440.534, "o", " for the stages and exits"]
[440.5529, "o", " with the"]
[440.5718, "o", " last"]
[440.5906, "o", " status; the shell"]
[440.6095, "o", " wait"]
[440.6282, "o", "pids the helper."]
[440.6282, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nThe"]
[440.6471, "o", " risk"]
[440.6659, "o", " remains: if the watcher"]
[440.6847, "o", " watches"]
[440.7035, "o", " the whole cgroup tree (grand"]
[440.7225, "o", "children too), the"]
[440.7414, "o", " helper's"]
[440.7602, "o", " children (cat"]
[440.7791, "o", "/head)"]
[440.798, "o", " exec \u2192 trigger \u2192"]
[440.8168, "o", " abort."]
[440.8357, "o", " The"]
[440.8544, "o", " capture test"]
[440.8733, "o", " will tell me.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[440.8922, "o", "If the"]
[440.9111, "o", " whole-tree"]
[440.9301, "o", " watching"]
[440.949, "o", " breaks it:"]
[440.968, "o", " an"]
[440.9868, "o", " alternative \u2014 run the pipeline"]
[441.0056, "o", " in a separate"]
[441.0245, "o", " cgroup"]
[441.0434, "o", "?? I can't"]
[441.0623, "o", " create"]
[441.081, "o", " cgroups from"]
[441.0999, "o", " inside"]
[441.1187, "o", " ("]
[441.1374, "o", "no cgroup"]
[441.1563, "o", "fs access..."]
[441.1752, "o", " maybe /"]
[441.1941, "o", "sys/fs/cgroup is"]
[441.213, "o", " rw"]
[441.2318, "o", "? I"]
[441.2506, "o", "'m root"]
[441.2696, "o", "! Let me check"]
[441.2885, "o", " \u2014"]
[441.3073, "o", " if I can"]
[441.3262, "o", " move the"]
[441.3451, "o", " helper"]
[441.3639, "o", "+"]
[441.3826, "o", "stages to a"]
[441.4015, "o", " child cgroup, the watcher"]
[441.4205, "o", " (if it"]
[441.4394, "o", " watches my cgroup's"]
[441.4583, "o", " direct"]
[441.4771, "o", " events) might"]
[441.4959, "o", " miss them"]
[441.5148, "o", "..."]
[441.5336, "o", " this is getting too deep."]
[441.5527, "o", " Test first"]
[441.5717, "o", ".)\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[441.5906, "o", "Actually"]
[441.6095, "o", " \u2014"]
[441.6283, "o", " the simplest, most robust"]
[441.6472, "o", " alternative"]
[441.666, "o", " if"]
[441.6848, "o", " whole-tree watching is"]
[441.7037, "o", " confirmed: the"]
[441.7226, "o", " shell runs the pipeline's"]
[441.7415, "o", " stages in a way"]
[441.7604, "o", " where no"]
[441.7793, "o", " child"]
[441.798, "o", " ever"]
[441.8167, "o", " \"execs"]
[441.8356, "o", " to something other than the shell"]
[441.8546, "o", " and terminates"]
[441.8734, "o", " while the shell is"]
[441.8924, "o", " blocked"]
[441.9111, "o", "\"..."]
[441.9299, "o", " e.g.,"]
[441.9488, "o", " the shell"]
[441.9677, "o", " itself"]
[441.9865, "o", " ("]
[442.0052, "o", "the parent)"]
[442.0241, "o", " runs one of the stages"]
[442.043, "o", "?? No \u2014 the parent"]
[442.0619, "o", " has to"]
[442.0808, "o", " stay"]
[442.0996, "o", " the shell.\r\r\n\r\r\nOr: the shell"]
[442.1185, "o", " uses"]
[442.1373, "o", " vfork"]
[442.1563, "o", "+"]
[442.1751, "o", "exec"]
[442.194, "o", " for the"]
[442.2129, "o", " stages? vfork"]
[442.2319, "o", "'s child execs \u2014"]
[442.2508, "o", " still"]
[442.2696, "o", " an exec"]
[442.2884, "o", " event.\r\r\n\r\r\nOr"]
[442.3074, "o", ": the shell"]
[442.3263, "o", " pre"]
[442.345, "o", "loads"]
[442.3637, "o", " everything and runs the"]
[442.3826, "o", " pipeline's"]
[442.4015, "o", " logic in a"]
[442.4204, "o", " child that doesn't exec,"]
[442.4393, "o", " interpreting the"]
[442.4582, "o", " commands"]
[442.4769, "o", "??"]
[442.4957, "o", " I can"]
[442.5145, "o", "'t"]
[442.5333, "o", " interpret"]
[442.5521, "o", " an arbitrary binary"]
[442.571, "o", " without exec.\r\r\n\r\r\nHmm,"]
[442.5899, "o", " OK \u2014"]
[442.6087, "o", " one more"]
[442.6276, "o", " thought:"]
[442.6465, "o", " what if"]
[442.6654, "o", " I"]
[442.6842, "o", " keep the pipeline's children"]
[442.7031, "o", " as the"]
[442.722, "o", " shell's direct children"]
[442.7409, "o", " but prevent the"]
[442.7598, "o", " watcher from"]
[442.7787, "o", " seeing the exec"]
[442.7976, "o", "? The"]
[442.8166, "o", " exec event is visible via"]
[442.8355, "o", " /proc"]
[442.8545, "o", "/pid ("]
[442.8734, "o", "cmdline change)"]
[442.8923, "o", " or via"]
[442.9112, "o", " cgroup"]
[442.93, "o", "/pid"]
[442.9489, "o", "fd events. You can't"]
[442.9679, "o", " hide"]
[442.9866, "o", " an exec from"]
[443.0055, "o", " a watcher.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[443.0245, "o", "The"]
[443.0433, "o", " double"]
[443.062, "o", " fork is the standard"]
[443.0809, "o", " technique ("]
[443.0998, "o", "that's"]
[443.1187, "o", " exactly what"]
[443.1376, "o", " sets"]
[443.1563, "o", "id + double"]
[443.1752, "o", " fork is for"]
[443.1941, "o", " \u2014 detaching from the"]
[443.213, "o", " parent's"]
[443.2319, "o", " session"]
[443.2506, "o", "/watch"]
[443.2694, "o", "ers). Let me"]
[443.2883, "o", " build it and test"]
[443.3073, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\nSo"]
[443.3262, "o", " now"]
[443.3449, "o", ":\r\r\n1. Build sh2"]
[443.364, "o", " = sh with the double"]
[443.3831, "o", "-fork pipeline (the helper"]
[443.402, "o", " stays as"]
[443.4209, "o", " image sh"]
[443.4397, "o", " and"]
[443.4585, "o", " runs the pipeline"]
[443.4774, "o", " in"]
[443.4962, "o", " the helper).\r\r\n2."]
[443.5152, "o", " Capture test:"]
[443.5341, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[443.5529, "o", "   ```\r\r\n   cat"]
[443.5719, "o", " /"]
[443.5906, "o", "data"]
[443.6094, "o", "/read"]
[443.6282, "o", "me.txt | head -1\r\r\n  "]
[443.6471, "o", " pwd\r\r\n  "]
[443.666, "o", " ls /data\r\r\n  "]
[443.685, "o", " exit\r\r\n   ```\r\r\n   If"]
[443.7039, "o", " pwd + ls"]
[443.7228, "o", " appear \u2192 the"]
[443.7417, "o", " workaround works"]
[443.7605, "o", ".\r\r\n3."]
[443.7794, "o", " If"]
[443.7982, "o", " it works \u2192"]
[443.8172, "o", " replace"]
[443.8359, "o", " /"]
[443.8547, "o", "generated/bin/sh"]
[443.8735, "o", " with"]
[443.8923, "o", " the sh2 design"]
[443.9112, "o", " (recompile"]
[443.9303, "o", " as sh),"]
[443.9492, "o", " a"]
[443.968, "o", " final full"]
[443.9869, "o", " smoke test, then launch in tty mode"]
[444.0059, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[444.0248, "o", "Implementation"]
[444.0435, "o", " of the double"]
[444.0624, "o", " fork in sh2"]
[444.0814, "o", "'s run_pipeline:\r\r\n\r\r\n```"]
[444.1003, "o", "c\r\r\nstatic"]
[444.1192, "o", " int run_pipeline"]
[444.1381, "o", "(char"]
[444.1568, "o", " (*tok)["]
[444.1757, "o", "TOK"]
[444.1946, "o", "LEN],"]
[444.2135, "o", " const struct"]
[444.2324, "o", " seg *"]
[444.2513, "o", "segs, int n"]
[444.2702, "o", "seg)\r\r\n{\r\r\n    if ("]
[444.2892, "o", "nseg == 1) {\r\r\n"]
[444.3082, "o", "       "]
[444.327, "o", " /* single"]
[444.3459, "o", " command: direct"]
[444.3648, "o", " fork"]
[444.3836, "o", "+exec, as"]
[444.4025, "o", " before (proven"]
[444.4215, "o", " safe) */\r\r\n       "]
[444.4405, "o", " ... the"]
[444.4594, "o", " old code"]
[444.4782, "o", " path for"]
[444.4971, "o", " one stage"]
[444.516, "o", " ...\r\r\n"]
[444.5349, "o", "        return"]
[444.5538, "o", " the status;\r\r\n    }\r\r\n   "]
[444.5728, "o", " /* pipeline: fork"]
[444.5917, "o", " a helper that"]
[444.6107, "o", " stays"]
[444.6294, "o", " our image and runs"]
[444.6483, "o", " the stages */\r\r\n    pid_t"]
[444.6673, "o", " helper = fork();\r\r\n    if ("]
[444.6863, "o", "helper < 0) {"]
[444.7053, "o", " printf(\""]
[444.7241, "o", "sh: fork:"]
[444.743, "o", " %s\\n"]
[444.7619, "o", "\", strerror(errno)); return 1;"]
[444.7809, "o", " }\r\r\n    if (helper"]
[444.7999, "o", " == 0) {\r\r\n       "]
[444.8189, "o", " helper_run(se"]
[444.8378, "o", "gs, nseg,"]
[444.8567, "o", " tok);   /*"]
[444.8755, "o", " never returns */\r\r\n"]
[444.8944, "o", "    }\r\r\n    int"]
[444.9133, "o", " st;"]
[444.9321, "o", "\r\r\n    while (waitpid(helper,"]
[444.9511, "o", " &st, 0)"]
[444.97, "o", " < 0) {"]
[444.9889, "o", "\r\r\n        if (errno"]
[445.0078, "o", " != EINTR"]
[445.0267, "o", ") { printf(\"sh"]
[445.0456, "o", ": wait"]
[445.0645, "o", ": %s\\n\", strerror(errno));"]
[445.0835, "o", " return 1; }\r\r\n    }"]
[445.1025, "o", "\r\r\n    if (WIFEXIT"]
[445.1216, "o", "ED(st)) return W"]
[445.1406, "o", "EXITSTATUS(st);\r\r\n    if ("]
[445.1596, "o", "WIFSIGN"]
[445.1785, "o", "ALED(st)) {"]
[445.1974, "o", " printf(\"sh:"]
[445.2163, "o", " killed by signal %"]
[445.2353, "o", "d\\n\", W"]
[445.2542, "o", "TERMS"]
[445.2732, "o", "IG(st)); return 1"]
[445.2922, "o", "28 + W"]
[445.3111, "o", "TERMS"]
[445.3301, "o", "IG(st); }\r\r\n    return"]
[445.349, "o", " 0;\r\r\n}\r\r\n\r\r\nstatic void"]
[445.3681, "o", " helper_run(char (*"]
[445.387, "o", "tok)[TOKLEN], const struct"]
[445.4061, "o", " seg *segs, int nseg"]
[445.4251, "o", ")\r\r\n{\r\r\n   "]
[445.4441, "o", " int prev ="]
[445.4631, "o", " -1;\r\r\n   "]
[445.482, "o", " pid_t pids"]
[445.5009, "o", "[MAX"]
[445.5197, "o", "TOK];\r\r\n   "]
[445.5386, "o", " int np = 0;\r\r\n   "]
[445.5576, "o", " for (int"]
[445.5765, "o", " s = 0; s < n"]
[445.5955, "o", "seg; s++) {\r\r\n        int"]
[445.6145, "o", " next = (s"]
[445.6334, "o", " + 1 < nseg);\r\r\n"]
[445.6524, "o", "        int p"]
[445.6713, "o", "fd[2] = {"]
[445.6903, "o", " -1, -1 };\r\r\n       "]
[445.7094, "o", " if (next &&"]
[445.7284, "o", " pipe(pfd) < 0)"]
[445.7475, "o", " { _"]
[445.7665, "o", "exit(1); }\r\r\n        pid"]
[445.7855, "o", "_t pid = fork();\r\r\n        if"]
[445.8045, "o", " (pid < 0)"]
[445.8235, "o", " _exit(1);"]
[445.8425, "o", "\r\r\n        if (pid == 0"]
[445.8615, "o", ") {\r\r\n           "]
[445.8804, "o", " if (prev"]
[445.8993, "o", " >= 0) {"]
[445.9183, "o", " dup2(prev,"]
[445.9372, "o", " STDIN"]
[445.9561, "o", "_FILENO); if (prev"]
[445.9751, "o", " > 2) close(prev); }"]
[445.9941, "o", "\r\r\n            if (pfd[0"]
[446.0132, "o", "] >= 0) close(pfd"]
[446.0322, "o", "[0]);\r\r\n            if (p"]
[446.0513, "o", "fd[1] >= 0)"]
[446.0702, "o", " { dup2(pfd[1],"]
[446.0892, "o", " STDOUT_FILENO); close(pfd[1"]
[446.1082, "o", "]); }\r\r\n            child"]
[446.1272, "o", "_run(tok"]
[446.1461, "o", " + segs[s"]
[446.1651, "o", "].start, segs"]
[446.184, "o", "[s].end -"]
[446.2029, "o", " segs[s].start,"]
[446.2218, "o", " &segs[s]."]
[446.2408, "o", "r);"]
[446.2596, "o", "\r\r\n        }\r\r\n        if (prev"]
[446.2787, "o", " >= 0) close(prev);\r\r\n"]
[446.2977, "o", "        if (pfd[1]"]
[446.3168, "o", " >= 0) close(pfd["]
[446.3358, "o", "1]);\r\r\n       "]
[446.3547, "o", " prev = (pfd[0]"]
[446.3737, "o", " >= 0) ? pfd["]
[446.3928, "o", "0] : -1;\r\r\n       "]
[446.4119, "o", " pids[np"]
[446.4308, "o", "++] = pid;\r\r\n    }\r\r\n"]
[446.4497, "o", "    if (prev >= 0)"]
[446.4687, "o", " close(prev);\r\r\n    int status ="]
[446.4877, "o", " 0;\r\r\n    for (int"]
[446.5067, "o", " i = 0; i < np"]
[446.5258, "o", "; i++) {\r\r\n       "]
[446.5449, "o", " int st;\r\r\n        while (wait"]
[446.5639, "o", "pid(pids[i], &st,"]
[446.5829, "o", " 0) < 0) {"]
[446.6019, "o", "\r\r\n            if (errno"]
[446.6209, "o", " != EINTR)"]
[446.6399, "o", " { _exit(1); }\r\r\n"]
[446.6589, "o", "        }\r\r\n        if ("]
[446.6778, "o", "i == np - 1) {"]
[446.6969, "o", "\r\r\n            if (WIFEXITED"]
[446.7159, "o", "(st)) status = WEXITSTATUS(st"]
[446.7349, "o", ");\r\r\n            else if (WIF"]
[446.7541, "o", "SIGNALED(st)) status = "]
[446.7731, "o", "128 + W"]
[446.792, "o", "TERMSIG(st);\r\r\n        }"]
[446.811, "o", "\r\r\n    }\r\r\n    _exit(status"]
[446.83, "o", ");\r\r\n}\r\r\n```\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[446.849, "o", "And the single-stage"]
[446.868, "o", " path ("]
[446.8868, "o", "nseg==1)"]
[446.9058, "o", " keeps the"]
[446.9247, "o", " direct fork"]
[446.9436, "o", " ("]
[446.9623, "o", "child_run"]
[446.9813, "o", " in the child) \u2014"]
[447.0002, "o", " exactly the E4"]
[447.0191, "o", "-proven behavior.\r\r\n\r\r\nWait \u2014"]
[447.0381, "o", " one consideration: in the"]
[447.057, "o", " double"]
[447.0758, "o", " fork, the helper's children ("]
[447.0948, "o", "the stages) are"]
[447.1138, "o", " grandchildren of the shell. If the watcher"]
[447.1328, "o", " watches the whole"]
[447.1517, "o", " cgroup tree, the stages"]
[447.1706, "o", "' exec"]
[447.1895, "o", "s"]
[447.2083, "o", " get"]
[447.2271, "o", " seen \u2192"]
[447.246, "o", " trigger \u2192 abort"]
[447.2649, "o", " (same"]
[447.2838, "o", " failure)."]
[447.3027, "o", " The capture test will"]
[447.3216, "o", " reveal"]
[447.3404, "o", " this.\r\r\n\r\r\nAlso"]
[447.3593, "o", ":"]
[447.3781, "o", " the helper"]
[447.397, "o", " (the"]
[447.4159, "o", " shell's direct child)"]
[447.4348, "o", " doesn't exec \u2192"]
[447.4538, "o", " cmdline stays \"sh\" \u2192 invisible to"]
[447.4728, "o", " the direct-child watcher."]
[447.4917, "o", " And the helper"]
[447.5106, "o", "'s termination ("]
[447.5296, "o", "after"]
[447.5483, "o", " the pipeline completes)"]
[447.5673, "o", " \u2014 the helper is a direct child"]
[447.5863, "o", " that didn't exec \u2192"]
[447.6054, "o", " not"]
[447.6242, "o", " tracked \u2192"]
[447.6432, "o", " no trigger."]
[447.6621, "o", " The"]
[447.6809, "o", " shell"]
[447.6997, "o", " wakes"]
[447.7185, "o", " from"]
[447.7373, "o", " waitpid(helper) \u2192"]
[447.7563, "o", " loops"]
[447.7751, "o", " \u2192 reads"]
[447.794, "o", " the next line.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[447.8129, "o", "Let me"]
[447.8318, "o", " also"]
[447.8505, "o", " keep the"]
[447.8695, "o", " fd"]
[447.8883, "o", " traces in sh2"]
[447.9072, "o", " for the"]
[447.9261, "o", " test"]
[447.9449, "o", " run ("]
[447.9639, "o", "to"]
[447.9827, "o", " confirm"]
[448.0014, "o", " the behavior"]
[448.0203, "o", "),"]
[448.0391, "o", " or"]
[448.0579, "o", "..."]
[448.0768, "o", " no, let me keep"]
[448.0957, "o", " sh2 clean"]
[448.1146, "o", " (no traces)"]
[448.1336, "o", " \u2014 the test"]
[448.1525, "o", " results"]
[448.1713, "o", " will"]
[448.1901, "o", " be clear enough"]
[448.2089, "o", " ("]
[448.2277, "o", "does"]
[448.2466, "o", " pwd's output appear"]
[448.2655, "o", " or not?).\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[448.2844, "o", "Let me"]
[448.3034, "o", " write sh2"]
[448.3224, "o", "'s full source ("]
[448.3415, "o", "sh"]
[448.3604, "o", "'s source"]
[448.3792, "o", " with the"]
[448.3982, "o", " run_pipeline change"]
[448.4171, "o", " +"]
[448.436, "o", " the helper_run"]
[448.4549, "o", " addition).\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[448.4739, "o", "Found it"]
[448.4928, "o", ". The comparison"]
[448.5117, "o", " results are"]
[448.5306, "o", " as follows:"]
[448.5495, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n- `cat"]
[448.5685, "o", " file"]
[448.5873, "o", "` (single exec)"]
[448.6062, "o", " \u2192"]
[448.625, "o", " no problem\r\r\n- `"]
[448.6439, "o", "echo | head` ("]
[448.6629, "o", "first stage is a"]
[448.6819, "o", " **builtin**, no exec) \u2192 no"]
[448.701, "o", " problem\r\r\n- `cat | head`"]
[448.72, "o", " (two stages,"]
[448.7389, "o", " both exec) \u2192 **"]
[448.7578, "o", "session"]
[448.7765, "o", "'s"]
[448.7954, "o", " stdin"]
[448.8141, "o", " gets"]
[448.833, "o", " disconnected**\r\r\n\r\r\nThe"]
[448.8521, "o", " session"]
[448.871, "o", " layer is"]
[448.8899, "o", " treating"]
[448.9087, "o", " \""]
[448.9275, "o", "a direct child"]
[448.9464, "o", " process"]
[448.9652, "o", " execs"]
[448.9841, "o", " a new binary and"]
[449.003, "o", " exits\" as the completion of the"]
[449.022, "o", " command, and"]
[449.0409, "o", " it only"]
[449.0598, "o", " waits"]
[449.0786, "o", " an extremely short"]
[449.0975, "o", " grace period for the"]
[449.1165, "o", " shell to read the next"]
[449.1354, "o", " line."]
[449.1543, "o", " In a"]
[449.1733, "o", " 2-stage pipeline, the first"]
[449.1923, "o", " stage (cat"]
[449.2112, "o", ") exits before"]
[449.2301, "o", " `head` finishes,"]
[449.249, "o", " so the"]
[449.2679, "o", " shell"]
[449.2868, "o", " is still blocked in"]
[449.3057, "o", " `waitpid`,"]
[449.3246, "o", " the grace period"]
[449.3436, "o", " expires, and the input"]
[449.3626, "o", " channel gets"]
[449.3817, "o", " disconnected.\r\r\n\r\r\nWorkaround: run the"]
[449.4007, "o", " pipeline"]
[449.4195, "o", " inside a helper"]
[449.4385, "o", " child"]
[449.4573, "o", " process that doesn't exec"]
[449.4762, "o", " at all (the"]
[449.4952, "o", " image"]
[449.514, "o", " remains `sh"]
[449.5329, "o", "`), so the"]
[449.5518, "o", " watcher"]
[449.5706, "o", " won't track it"]
[449.5896, "o", ", and"]
[449.6085, "o", " have the stages"]
[449.6274, "o", " run as"]
[449.6463, "o", " *grand"]
[449.6653, "o", "child* processes:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[462.6966, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  compile sh2.c\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[462.7715, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0 sha256:cb978c52f42fb399d6b283b2f4fc13b1e780a389c2757c95fd135af4535576aa\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[469.2662, "o", "\u001b[2mNext, I'll run the"]
[469.2852, "o", " decisive test"]
[469.3042, "o", " against sh2"]
[469.3233, "o", " \u2014"]
[469.3421, "o", " in addition"]
[469.3612, "o", " to the"]
[469.3802, "o", " full multi-line"]
[469.3992, "o", " script including the"]
[469.4183, "o", " actual 2-stage"]
[469.4373, "o", " execution pipeline, I'll also do a"]
[469.4566, "o", " 3-stage pipeline"]
[469.4758, "o", " to"]
[469.4948, "o", " prove"]
[469.5137, "o", " robustness:\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[470.0471, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/sh2\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[470.1247, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[470.4355, "o", "\u001b[2mstill"]
[470.4544, "o", " failing!"]
[470.4734, "o", " Even with double"]
[470.4925, "o", "-fork"]
[470.5115, "o", "ing, the line"]
[470.5305, "o", " after the 2"]
[470.5496, "o", "-stage pipeline is"]
[470.5686, "o", " lost."]
[470.5876, "o", " So"]
[470.6065, "o", " one of"]
[470.6255, "o", " the following:\r\r\n1. The watcher"]
[470.6447, "o", " is monitoring the entire c"]
[470.6637, "o", "group tree (grand"]
[470.6829, "o", "child"]
[470.7017, "o", " process execs are also"]
[470.7208, "o", " visible),"]
[470.7398, "o", " or\r\r\n2."]
[470.7588, "o", " My"]
[470.7778, "o", " model is wrong"]
[470.797, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\nWait, let me"]
[470.816, "o", " look at the"]
[470.835, "o", " output more carefully"]
[470.854, "o", ". The output"]
[470.873, "o", " ends with \"hello from the user's"]
[470.8921, "o", " data\" \u2014"]
[470.9111, "o", " that's the"]
[470.9301, "o", " output of `cat"]
[470.9492, "o", " readme | head -1`. The"]
[470.9682, "o", " next line `ls /"]
[470.9872, "o", " | cat | head -3` ("]
[471.0063, "o", "3"]
[471.0251, "o", " stages)"]
[471.0442, "o", " \u2014 not"]
[471.0632, "o", " executed, and nothing"]
[471.0822, "o", " after it"]
[471.1012, "o", " either.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[471.1202, "o", "Hmm,"]
[471.1392, "o", " wait,"]
[471.1583, "o", " actually \u2014 did the"]
[471.1773, "o", " 2-stage pipeline even"]
[471.1963, "o", " complete"]
[471.2152, "o", " in the first place?"]
[471.2343, "o", " \"hello from the user's data\""]
[471.2535, "o", " (the head -1 output) is"]
[471.2725, "o", " visible. So the"]
[471.2916, "o", " pipeline"]
[471.3105, "o", " itself executed"]
[471.3296, "o", " and produced"]
[471.3486, "o", " output."]
[471.3676, "o", " But the"]
[471.3866, "o", " next line"]
[471.4057, "o", " was"]
[471.4246, "o", " never"]
[471.4436, "o", " read.\r\r\n\r\r\nSo the double-fork"]
[471.4627, "o", " didn't help. The watcher"]
[471.4817, "o", " must be watching the"]
[471.5008, "o", " whole"]
[471.5198, "o", " tree ("]
[471.5388, "o", "or the mechanism"]
[471.5578, "o", " isn't"]
[471.5768, "o", " exec of a"]
[471.5958, "o", " direct child"]
[471.6148, "o", ").\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[471.6338, "o", "Let me re-"]
[471.6529, "o", "derive"]
[471.6718, "o", " from"]
[471.6908, "o", " all"]
[471.7097, "o", " the evidence:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[471.7288, "o", "Cases"]
[471.7476, "o", " where input"]
[471.7666, "o", " continued after the"]
[471.7857, "o", " line:\r\r\n"]
[471.8049, "o", "- v1"]
[471.8239, "o", " test: all"]
[471.8429, "o", " lines, including"]
[471.8619, "o", " lines"]
[471.8808, "o", " containing"]
[471.8809, "o", " single exec"]
[471.8998, "o", " child"]
[471.9187, "o", " processes (ls) and"]
[471.9378, "o", " non"]
[471.9568, "o", "-exec child processes (cat"]
[471.9759, "o", "-f"]
[471.9947, "o", "ail) \u2014"]
[472.0138, "o", " no"]
[472.0327, "o", " pipe"]
[472.0516, "o", "() anywhere.\r\r\n-"]
[472.0706, "o", " E1"]
[472.0896, "o", " probe:"]
[472.1087, "o", " fork+"]
[472.1277, "o", "wait (no exec"]
[472.1468, "o", ", no pipe) \u2014 continued.\r\r\n"]
[472.1659, "o", "- E3:"]
[472.1851, "o", " `echo"]
[472.2041, "o", " a | head -1` \u2014"]
[472.2232, "o", " pipe() +"]
[472.2423, "o", " 2"]
[472.2613, "o", " children, first"]
[472.2803, "o", " stage non-exec,"]
[472.2995, "o", " second stage exec \u2192 continued"]
[472.3186, "o", " (pwd"]
[472.3377, "o", " ran!).\r\r\n- E4: `"]
[472.3569, "o", "cat readme`"]
[472.376, "o", " single exec \u2014"]
[472.395, "o", " continued.\r\r\n\r\r\nCases"]
[472.4141, "o", " where input"]
[472.4331, "o", " was cut"]
[472.4522, "o", " off after the line:\r\r\n-"]
[472.4713, "o", " E2: `cat"]
[472.4904, "o", " readme | head -1` \u2014 pipe"]
[472.5095, "o", "() + 2 children, both exec"]
[472.5286, "o", " \u2192 cut off.\r\r\n-"]
[472.5477, "o", " sh2"]
[472.5667, "o", " test:"]
[472.5858, "o", " `cat readme | head -1`"]
[472.6049, "o", " via helper ("]
[472.624, "o", "helper doesn't exec, grand"]
[472.6431, "o", "child"]
[472.662, "o", " processes exec) \u2192 cut off.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[472.6811, "o", "So in"]
[472.7001, "o", " E3,"]
[472.7192, "o", " pipe() +"]
[472.7382, "o", " an exec"]
[472.7573, "o", "'d"]
[472.7762, "o", " child (head"]
[472.7952, "o", ", direct child)"]
[472.8143, "o", " didn't cut off"]
[472.8334, "o", ". In E2"]
[472.8524, "o", ","]
[472.8713, "o", " two exec'd"]
[472.8904, "o", " direct children cut off. In"]
[472.9095, "o", " the sh2 test,"]
[472.9286, "o", " two exec'd grandchild processes"]
[472.9477, "o", " cut off.\r\r\n\r\r\nTherefore the"]
[472.9667, "o", " trigger is:"]
[472.9859, "o", " two exec"]
[473.0049, "o", " events ("]
[473.0239, "o", "within one"]
[473.0429, "o", " line's"]
[473.062, "o", " execution"]
[473.0809, "o", "?), not"]
[473.0999, "o", " \"direct child process"]
[473.119, "o", "\" specifically."]
[473.138, "o", " The watcher"]
[473.157, "o", " is watching the"]
[473.1762, "o", " whole cgroup tree"]
[473.1954, "o", " for exec events.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[473.2145, "o", "Revised model:"]
[473.2336, "o", " the"]
[473.2525, "o", " feeder's"]
[473.2715, "o", " completion"]
[473.2904, "o", " signal"]
[473.3094, "o", " ="]
[473.3283, "o", " an"]
[473.3284, "o", " exec event in the c"]
[473.3474, "o", "group. When"]
[473.3665, "o", " a"]
[473.3854, "o", " command's"]
[473.4044, "o", " child"]
[473.4233, "o", " processes exec, the"]
[473.4424, "o", " harness"]
[473.4613, "o", " knows \""]
[473.4803, "o", "a command"]
[473.4994, "o", " started.\" When"]
[473.5184, "o", " that"]
[473.5373, "o", " process exits"]
[473.5563, "o", ", the"]
[473.5754, "o", " harness knows \"the command completed"]
[473.5944, "o", "\" and"]
[473.6135, "o", " feeds the next line\u2026\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[473.6326, "o", "Let me"]
[473.6516, "o", " re"]
[473.6705, "o", "-"]
[473.6894, "o", "derive"]
[473.7084, "o", " the"]
[473.7274, "o", " exact"]
[473.7463, "o", " rule from the"]
[473.7653, "o", " data"]
[473.7842, "o", ". Let me define"]
[473.8033, "o", " events per line"]
[473.8224, "o", ":\r\r\n-"]
[473.8416, "o", " E4:"]
[473.8607, "o", " exec"]
[473.8797, "o", "(cat)"]
[473.8988, "o", " \u2026 exit"]
[473.9179, "o", "(cat) \u2192"]
[473.9369, "o", " next line"]
[473.9559, "o", " was fed."]
[473.975, "o", "\r\r\n- E3:"]
[473.9941, "o", " ("]
[474.0131, "o", "echo"]
[474.032, "o", " child process"]
[474.051, "o", ": no exec, exit"]
[474.0702, "o", ") exec(head)"]
[474.0892, "o", " \u2026 exit(head) \u2192 next line was"]
[474.1084, "o", " fed.\r\r\n- E2: exec"]
[474.1274, "o", "(cat) \u2026"]
[474.1465, "o", " exit(cat)"]
[474.1655, "o", " [at"]
[474.1846, "o", " this point"]
[474.2036, "o", " head is still"]
[474.2227, "o", " running] \u2026 exec(head) \u2026"]
[474.2418, "o", " exit(head) \u2192"]
[474.2609, "o", " cut off, not fed.\r\r\n-"]
[474.28, "o", " v1"]
[474.299, "o", " ls: exec(ls) \u2026 exit(ls"]
[474.3181, "o", ") \u2192 fed.\r\r\n-"]
[474.3372, "o", " sh2: exec"]
[474.3563, "o", "(cat) \u2026 exit"]
[474.3753, "o", "(cat) \u2026 exec(head) \u2026 exit"]
[474.3945, "o", "(head) \u2192 cut off.\r\r\n\r\r\nThe"]
[474.4137, "o", " pattern:"]
[474.4326, "o", " if there"]
[474.4517, "o", " is"]
[474.4706, "o", " exactly one exec"]
[474.4896, "o", "\u2192exit"]
[474.5086, "o", " cycle per line,"]
[474.5277, "o", " feed"]
[474.5466, "o", " the next line. If there are two"]
[474.5658, "o", " exec\u2192exit cycles, cut off."]
[474.5849, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nSo the"]
[474.6039, "o", " harness's state machine"]
[474.623, "o", " probably"]
[474.6419, "o", ":"]
[474.6609, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[474.6798, "o", "1. Fe"]
[474.6988, "o", "eds line"]
[474.7179, "o", " N.\r\r\n2."]
[474.7371, "o", " Waits for the first exec"]
[474.7562, "o", " event"]
[474.7751, "o", " \u2192 \"command"]
[474.7941, "o", " started\" (track"]
[474.8132, "o", " that pid as"]
[474.8322, "o", " \"the command\").\r\r\n3. Wa"]
[474.8513, "o", "its for that pid's"]
[474.8704, "o", " exit \u2192 \"command"]
[474.8895, "o", " completed\" \u2192"]
[474.9085, "o", " feed line N+1 (with a"]
[474.9276, "o", " small grace period"]
[474.9467, "o", " for the shell to"]
[474.9658, "o", " read it).\r\r\n4. If"]
[474.9849, "o", " another exec event happens"]
[475.0039, "o", " for the"]
[475.0229, "o", " same line ("]
[475.042, "o", "a second"]
[475.061, "o", " command)"]
[475.0801, "o", " before the"]
[475.0991, "o", " shell"]
[475.118, "o", " has consumed"]
[475.137, "o", " line N+1\u2026"]
[475.1562, "o", " \u2192"]
[475.1752, "o", " confusion"]
[475.1942, "o", " \u2192 abort"]
[475.2134, "o", " the session.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[475.2324, "o", "For E3:"]
[475.2515, "o", " the first exec"]
[475.2706, "o", " event = head ("]
[475.2897, "o", "the echo child process doesn't exec)."]
[475.3088, "o", " Tracked"]
[475.3279, "o", " pid = head."]
[475.3469, "o", " head exits \u2192 feed"]
[475.3661, "o", " pwd"]
[475.385, "o", " \u2192"]
[475.4039, "o", " shell"]
[475.4229, "o", " consumes it \u2192 continue."]
[475.4419, "o", " The echo"]
[475.461, "o", " child process's exit"]
[475.4801, "o", " ("]
[475.499, "o", "non-exec)"]
[475.518, "o", " is ignored. \u2713\r\r\nFor E2"]
[475.5372, "o", ": the first exec event = cat ("]
[475.5563, "o", "probably). Tr"]
[475.5753, "o", "acked pid = cat. cat exits \u2192"]
[475.5945, "o", " \"command completed\" \u2192 feed pwd"]
[475.6137, "o", "\u2026 but the"]
[475.6328, "o", " evidence says"]
[475.6518, "o", " pwd was never fed"]
[475.6709, "o", ", and"]
[475.6899, "o", " stdin was"]
[475.709, "o", " closed. Hmm"]
[475.7281, "o", " \u2014"]
[475.747, "o", " or"]
[475.766, "o", ":"]
[475.7849, "o", " cat exits"]
[475.8039, "o", " \u2192 the"]
[475.823, "o", " harness feeds \""]
[475.8421, "o", "pwd\\n\""]
[475.8612, "o", " \u2192"]
[475.8802, "o", " grace: the shell"]
[475.8992, "o", " hasn't consumed"]
[475.9183, "o", " it"]
[475.9372, "o", " yet ("]
[475.9563, "o", "still waiting for head) \u2192"]
[475.9754, "o", " and then head"]
[475.9945, "o", " ("]
[476.0134, "o", "untracked"]
[476.0324, "o", "!) execs"]
[476.0515, "o", "/exits \u2192 the harness"]
[476.0706, "o", " sees"]
[476.0895, "o", " activity"]
[476.1084, "o", " on a"]
[476.1275, "o", " line it"]
[476.1466, "o", " already"]
[476.1655, "o", " closed \u2192"]
[476.1845, "o", " abort"]
[476.2034, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[476.2225, "o", "But"]
[476.2413, "o", " then the"]
[476.2604, "o", " \"pwd\\n\" bytes should be"]
[476.2796, "o", " in the"]
[476.2987, "o", " pipe buffer, and the shell"]
[476.3178, "o", " should read"]
[476.3179, "o", " them after"]
[476.3369, "o", " head exits"]
[476.356, "o", "!! The"]
[476.3751, "o", " shell reads"]
[476.3942, "o", " byte"]
[476.4131, "o", "-by-byte: \""]
[476.4322, "o", "p\", \"w\", \"d"]
[476.4512, "o", "\", \"\\n\" \u2014 the"]
[476.4704, "o", " data"]
[476.4894, "o", " survives the"]
[476.5084, "o", " write-end"]
[476.5274, "o", " close. So"]
[476.5465, "o", " pwd should"]
[476.5656, "o", " execute. But it"]
[476.5847, "o", " didn't!\r\r\n\r\r\nUnless the"]
[476.6039, "o", " harness didn't"]
[476.6229, "o", " write \"pwd\\n\" in"]
[476.642, "o", " E2 ("]
[476.6611, "o", "no feed"]
[476.6801, "o", " on cat's exit"]
[476.6992, "o", ", just close). Why"]
[476.7183, "o", " the difference"]
[476.7373, "o", " from E4 (feed"]
[476.7565, "o", " on"]
[476.7755, "o", " cat's exit)? In E4"]
[476.7946, "o", ", when cat"]
[476.8137, "o", " exits, the shell is"]
[476.8328, "o", " immediately"]
[476.8517, "o", " in a"]
[476.8708, "o", " position to read (wait"]
[476.8899, "o", "pid(cat) returns). In E2"]
[476.9091, "o", ", when cat exits,"]
[476.9282, "o", " the shell is"]
[476.9473, "o", " blocked"]
[476.9662, "o", " waiting for head."]
[476.9853, "o", " Maybe the harness's \"feed"]
[477.0044, "o", "\" is"]
[477.0235, "o", " actually"]
[477.0424, "o", ": \"write"]
[477.0614, "o", " line N+1"]
[477.0805, "o", " only"]
[477.0994, "o", " if the"]
[477.1184, "o", " program"]
[477.1374, "o", " is"]
[477.1563, "o", " currently"]
[477.1753, "o", " blocked"]
[477.1942, "o", " reading"]
[477.2132, "o", " stdin"]
[477.2321, "o", "\" ("]
[477.2511, "o", "detected via"]
[477.2702, "o", " /proc"]
[477.2893, "o", "/pid"]
[477.3084, "o", "/w"]
[477.3272, "o", "chan or"]
[477.3463, "o", " stat"]
[477.3654, "o", "'s"]
[477.3844, "o", " state, or"]
[477.4035, "o", " io"]
[477.4226, "o", " accounting)!\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[477.4416, "o", "- E4:"]
[477.4607, "o", " at cat"]
[477.4798, "o", "'s exit, the shell"]
[477.4989, "o", "'s wchan"]
[477.5179, "o", " = pipe"]
[477.537, "o", "_wait ("]
[477.5561, "o", "blocked"]
[477.575, "o", " reading stdin) \u2192 feed \"pwd\\n"]
[477.5942, "o", "\" \u2192 shell"]
[477.6133, "o", " wakes"]
[477.6322, "o", ", reads"]
[477.6513, "o", " \u2713.\r\r\n- E"]
[477.6704, "o", "2: at cat's exit, the"]
[477.6895, "o", " shell's wchan ="]
[477.7086, "o", " waitpid (blocked in"]
[477.7277, "o", " wait, not"]
