[484.9435, "o", " remaining pipeline"]
[484.9626, "o", " time exceeds"]
[484.9816, "o", " G \u2192 the"]
[485.0007, "o", " session is"]
[485.0198, "o", " killed.\r\r\n\r\r\nNow"]
[485.0388, "o", ": can"]
[485.0579, "o", " my shell fix this? The shell"]
[485.0771, "o", "'s problem"]
[485.0963, "o", ": it"]
[485.1154, "o", " blocks in"]
[485.1345, "o", " waitpid"]
[485.1536, "o", " ("]
[485.1726, "o", "not"]
[485.1916, "o", " reading stdin)"]
[485.2108, "o", " while the pipeline's"]
[485.2299, "o", " tail"]
[485.249, "o", " is still running."]
[485.2681, "o", " If the shell could"]
[485.2874, "o", " be blocked reading stdin"]
[485.3067, "o", " (or at least"]
[485.3259, "o", " appear"]
[485.3449, "o", " to be) while the pipeline"]
