[637.8789, "o", " an **interactive"]
[637.8987, "o", " tty session"]
[637.9185, "o", "**?"]
[637.9381, "o", " Since"]
[637.9577, "o", " I can't type"]
[637.9775, "o", " on the"]
[637.9972, "o", " user's console,"]
[638.0171, "o", " I'll simulate"]
[638.037, "o", " a"]
[638.0568, "o", " full interactive session using a pty"]
[638.0766, "o", ":\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[638.2355, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/ls /dev\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[638.3142, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[648.381, "o", "\u001b[2m/dev/ptmx"]
[648.4007, "o", " exists"]
[648.4203, "o", ", and /dev/pts"]
[648.44, "o", " is also"]
[648.4598, "o", " there. I"]
[648.4795, "o", " can build"]
[648.4993, "o", " ptytest using the ptmx"]
[648.5192, "o", " approach (no lib"]
[648.539, "o", "util needed).\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[648.5588, "o", "ptytest design:\r\r\n- Open"]
[648.5786, "o", " /dev/ptmx"]
[648.5985, "o", " (master)\r\r\n- TIO"]
[648.6183, "o", "CG"]
[648.638, "o", "PTN \u2192 pt"]
[648.6577, "o", "yn; TIO"]
[648.6775, "o", "CS"]
[648.6972, "o", "PT"]
[648.7169, "o", "L"]
[648.7367, "o", "CK 0;"]
[648.7565, "o", " open /dev/pts"]
[648.7778, "o", "/N"]
[648.796, "o", " (slave"]
[648.8157, "o", ", O"]
[648.8356, "o", "_RDWR|O_NOCTTY)\r\r\n"]
[648.8554, "o", "- fork:"]
[648.8752, "o", "\r\r\n  -"]
[648.895, "o", " Child: sets"]
[648.9148, "o", "id();"]
[648.9346, "o", " ioctl"]
[648.9542, "o", " TIOCS"]
[648.974, "o", "CTTY;"]
[648.9937, "o", " dup"]
[649.0134, "o", "2 slave \u2192 0,1,"]
[649.0332, "o", "2; close master"]
[649.053, "o", "/slave; exec"]
[649.0728, "o", " /"]
[649.0924, "o", "generated/bin/sh\r\r\n"]
[649.1122, "o", "  - Parent:"]
[649.132, "o", " close"]
[649.1517, "o", " slave; run"]
[649.1715, "o", " the"]
[649.1911, "o", " interactive session:\r\r\n"]
[649.2109, "o", "    - Wait"]
[649.2307, "o", "/read for the"]
[649.2505, "o", " banner + prompt ("]
[649.2704, "o", "read the"]
[649.2903, "o", " master for"]
[649.3102, "o", " about "]
[649.33, "o", "300ms)\r\r\n    -"]
[649.3498, "o", " Write \"ls /"]
[649.3696, "o", "data\\n\" \u2192"]
[649.3894, "o", " collect output for about "]
[649.4093, "o", "400ms\r\r\n    - Write"]
[649.4292, "o", " \"cat /data"]
[649.449, "o", "/readme.txt | head -"]
[649.4688, "o", "1\\n\" \u2192"]
[649.4887, "o", " collect for about 600ms"]
[649.5086, "o", "\r\r\n    - Write \""]
[649.5284, "o", "pwd\\n\" \u2192 collect for about "]
[649.5483, "o", "400ms"]
[649.5681, "o", " \u2192 check"]
[649.5879, "o", " whether the output contains \"/"]
[649.6077, "o", "data\""]
[649.6274, "o", " or \"/\""]
[649.6473, "o", "...\r\r\n    - Write \""]
[649.667, "o", "exit\\n\" \u2192 collect"]
[649.6868, "o", " until"]
[649.7064, "o", " EIO ("]
[649.7261, "o", "slave"]
[649.7457, "o", " gone) or timeout\r\r\n"]
[649.7654, "o", "-"]
[649.7851, "o", " Report"]
[649.8047, "o", " each"]
[649.8243, "o", " phase's output ("]
[649.8441, "o", "with"]
[649.8636, "o", " markers) to stderr, and"]
[649.8834, "o", " finally PASS"]
[649.9031, "o", "/FAIL:"]
[649.9228, "o", "\r\r\n  - PASS"]
[649.9425, "o", " condition: the"]
[649.9622, "o", " pwd phase's output contains the"]
[649.982, "o", " cwd"]
[650.0017, "o", " string"]
[650.0212, "o", " AND the shell exited"]
[650.041, "o", " normally after exit ("]
[650.0607, "o", "i.e.,"]
[650.0804, "o", " it"]
[650.1, "o", " was still alive).\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[650.1197, "o", "Reading"]
[650.1393, "o", " the master: read with a"]
[650.1592, "o", " timeout"]
[650.1788, "o", " \u2014 use"]
[650.1985, "o", " poll"]
[650.2181, "o", "() with a timeout"]
[650.238, "o", "; read"]
[650.2579, "o", " whatever is available"]
[650.2776, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[650.2974, "o", "Also,"]
[650.3172, "o", " I"]
[650.3369, "o", " need to"]
[650.3567, "o", " double-check that"]
[650.3764, "o", " the"]
[650.3961, "o", " pty"]
[650.4159, "o", "'s"]
[650.4355, "o", " termios"]
[650.4553, "o", " defaults"]
[650.4749, "o", " give"]
[650.4945, "o", " canonical mode"]
[650.5143, "o", " + echo \u2014"]
[650.5341, "o", " that's"]
[650.5539, "o", " right (the"]
[650.5737, "o", " pty default is"]
[650.5935, "o", " canonical"]
[650.6131, "o", ","]
[650.6328, "o", " echo on,"]
[650.6526, "o", " is"]
[650.6723, "o", "raw"]
[650.6919, "o", " off)."]
[650.7117, "o", " The shell's"]
[650.7315, "o", " isatty"]
[650.7513, "o", "(0"]
[650.771, "o", ")=1 \u2192 prompt"]
[650.7909, "o", " gets printed"]
[650.8106, "o", " \u2192 the"]
[650.8304, "o", " user"]
[650.8501, "o", " sees the prompt (echo"]
[650.8699, "o", " of input +"]
[650.8897, "o", " output).\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[650.9095, "o", "One important"]
[650.9293, "o", " detail: when"]
[650.9491, "o", " the shell"]
[650.9689, "o", " ("]
[650.9885, "o", "child) runs"]
[651.0085, "o", " a pipeline in"]
[651.0283, "o", " this pty"]
[651.0481, "o", " session, the"]
[651.0678, "o", " pipeline"]
[651.0875, "o", "'s child"]
[651.1072, "o", " processes ("]
[651.127, "o", "cat/head) also"]
[651.1468, "o", " hold the pty"]
[651.1666, "o", " slave (in"]
[651.1864, "o", "herited"]
[651.2061, "o", " fd 0"]
[651.2258, "o", "/1"]
[651.2456, "o", ") \u2014"]
[651.2654, "o", " that's normal"]
[651.2851, "o", " ("]
[651.3048, "o", "like a real user"]
[651.3246, "o", "'s"]
[651.3443, "o", " pipeline"]
[651.3639, "o", " on a"]
[651.3837, "o", " console)."]
[651.4034, "o", " The watcher's"]
[651.4232, "o", " behavior in this"]
[651.443, "o", " context"]
[651.4627, "o", " is"]
[651.4823, "o", " exactly what"]
[651.5021, "o", " I"]
[651.5218, "o", " want to"]
[651.5416, "o", " measure.\r\r\n\r\r\nAlso, the"]
[651.5614, "o", " harness"]
[651.5811, "o", " spawns"]
[651.6008, "o", " ptytest"]
[651.6206, "o", " ("]
[651.6403, "o", "me"]
[651.6599, "o", ")"]
[651.6796, "o", " \u2014"]
[651.6993, "o", " ptytest's c"]
[651.7191, "o", "group contains"]
[651.7389, "o", " ptytest + the shell"]
[651.7588, "o", " + the pipeline stages. The watcher"]
[651.7787, "o", " (if"]
[651.7984, "o", " any) sees the"]
[651.8182, "o", " same"]
[651.8379, "o", " tree"]
[651.8575, "o", " shape as the actual tty session."]
[651.8575, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[651.8774, "o", "Write"]
[651.897, "o", " ptytest"]
[651.9168, "o", " carefully:\r\r\n\r\r\n```c\r\r\n#include "]
[651.9368, "o", "<stdio.h>\r\r\n#include <stdlib.h"]
[651.9566, "o", ">\r\r\n#include <string"]
[651.9567, "o", ".h>\r\r\n"]
[651.9765, "o", "#include <unistd.h>\r\r\n#include "]
[651.9963, "o", "<fcntl.h>\r\r\n#include "]
[652.0162, "o", "<errno.h>\r\r\n#include "]
[652.0361, "o", "<poll.h>\r\r\n#include <sys"]
[652.056, "o", "/ioctl.h>\r\r\n#include <sys"]
[652.076, "o", "/wait"]
[652.0956, "o", ".h>\r\r\n#include <sys"]
[652.1154, "o", "/types.h>"]
[652.1352, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nstatic int"]
[652.155, "o", " master"]
[652.1748, "o", "_fd;\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[652.1945, "o", "/* Read available output"]
[652.2143, "o", " from the master for up to ms"]
[652.2342, "o", " milliseconds,"]
[652.254, "o", " printing it */\r\r\n"]
[652.2737, "o", "static int"]
[652.2935, "o", " collect"]
[652.3131, "o", "(int ms,"]
[652.3329, "o", " const char *"]
[652.3526, "o", "label)\r\r\n{\r\r\n    int"]
[652.3725, "o", " total = 0;\r\r\n    char"]
[652.3924, "o", " buf["]
[652.4122, "o", "4096];\r\r\n    while"]
[652.4321, "o", " (ms > 0) {\r\r\n"]
[652.4519, "o", "        struct"]
[652.4717, "o", " poll"]
[652.4915, "o", "fd"]
[652.5113, "o", " p = {"]
[652.5312, "o", " master_fd,"]
[652.551, "o", " POLLIN, 0 };\r\r\n       "]
[652.5709, "o", " int r = poll"]
[652.5907, "o", "(&p, 1"]
[652.6105, "o", ","]
[652.6301, "o", " "]
[652.6498, "o", "50);"]
[652.6696, "o", "  /*"]
[652.6894, "o", " 50ms chunk"]
[652.7091, "o", " so we can"]
[652.7289, "o", " return"]
[652.7486, "o", " when it"]
[652.7684, "o", " goes quiet */\r\r\n        if (r"]
[652.7882, "o", " < 0) {\r\r\n           "]
[652.8081, "o", " if (errno == E"]
[652.8279, "o", "INTR)"]
[652.8476, "o", " continue;\r\r\n           "]
[652.8674, "o", " break;\r\r\n        }\r\r\n        if"]
[652.8874, "o", " (r == 0) {\r\r\n"]
[652.9073, "o", "            /*"]
[652.9273, "o", " 50ms of quiet \u2014 check"]
[652.9472, "o", " whether there's"]
[652.967, "o", " still"]
[652.9867, "o", " something"]
[653.0063, "o", " buffered"]
[653.026, "o", "?"]
[653.0457, "o", " poll"]
[653.0654, "o", " says"]
[653.085, "o", " no */\r\r\n           "]
[653.1048, "o", " break;\r\r\n        }\r\r\n        ssize"]
[653.1247, "o", "_t n = read(master_fd,"]
[653.1446, "o", " buf, sizeof"]
[653.1643, "o", " buf);\r\r\n        if (n"]
[653.1842, "o", " > 0) {\r\r\n           "]
[653.204, "o", " fwrite(buf, "]
[653.2239, "o", "1,"]
[653.2436, "o", " (size_t)n,"]
[653.2634, "o", " stderr);\r\r\n            total +="]
[653.2833, "o", " (int)n;\r\r\n            ms"]
[653.3031, "o", " -= 50;"]
[653.3228, "o", "  /*"]
[653.3427, "o", " approximate: keep"]
[653.3626, "o", " collecting"]
[653.3824, "o", " while there's"]
[653.4022, "o", " data */\r\r\n        } else if ("]
[653.4221, "o", "n == 0) {\r\r\n           "]
[653.442, "o", " fprintf(stderr,"]
[653.4618, "o", " \"\\n"]
[653.4815, "o", "[ptytest:"]
[653.5014, "o", " EOF"]
[653.5211, "o", " on pty]\\n\");\r\r\n           "]
[653.5409, "o", " break;\r\r\n        } else"]
[653.5608, "o", " {\r\r\n            if (errno =="]
[653.5608, "o", " E"]
[653.5807, "o", "IO)"]
[653.6005, "o", " {"]
[653.6202, "o", " fprintf(stderr, \"\\n[ptytest"]
[653.6401, "o", ": EIO"]
[653.6599, "o", " \u2014 slave"]
[653.6797, "o", " side"]
[653.6993, "o", " gone"]
[653.719, "o", " (shell exited"]
[653.7388, "o", ")]\\n\"); break;"]
[653.7586, "o", " }\r\r\n            if (errno == E"]
[653.7786, "o", "INTR) continue;\r\r\n"]
[653.7984, "o", "            break;\r\r\n        }\r\r\n   "]
[653.8183, "o", " }\r\r\n    ("]
[653.8381, "o", "void)label;\r\r\n    return total"]
[653.858, "o", ";\r\r\n}\r\r\n\r\r\nstatic"]
[653.8778, "o", " void type(const char"]
[653.8977, "o", " *s)\r\r\n{\r\r\n   "]
[653.9175, "o", " size_t"]
[653.9373, "o", " off = 0;\r\r\n    while"]
[653.9572, "o", " (off < strlen(s)) {\r\r\n"]
[653.9771, "o", "        ssize_t"]
[653.9969, "o", " w = write(master_fd, s"]
[654.0167, "o", " + off, strlen(s"]
[654.0366, "o", ") - off);\r\r\n        if ("]
[654.0565, "o", "w < 0) {\r\r\n"]
[654.0764, "o", "            if (errno == EINTR)"]
[654.0963, "o", " continue;\r\r\n           "]
[654.1161, "o", " fprintf(stderr, \"[ptytest"]
[654.136, "o", ": write"]
[654.1557, "o", " error]\\n\");\r\r\n           "]
[654.1757, "o", " return;\r\r\n        }\r\r\n        off"]
[654.1955, "o", " += (size_t)w;\r\r\n"]
[654.2154, "o", "    }\r\r\n}\r\r\n\r\r\nint main(void"]
[654.2353, "o", ")\r\r\n{\r\r\n   "]
[654.2551, "o", " master_fd = open(\"/"]
[654.2749, "o", "dev/ptmx\","]
[654.275, "o", " O_RDWR"]
[654.2948, "o", " |"]
[654.3145, "o", " O_NOCTTY);\r\r\n    if"]
[654.3345, "o", " (master_fd < 0) {"]
[654.3544, "o", " perror(\"open"]
[654.3742, "o", " ptmx\"); return "]
[654.394, "o", "2; }\r\r\n    int pt"]
[654.4139, "o", "yn;\r\r\n    if (ioctl"]
[654.4338, "o", "(master_fd, TIOCGPTN"]
[654.4537, "o", ", &"]
[654.4735, "o", "ptyn) < 0) {"]
[654.4934, "o", " perror(\"TIOCGPTN\");"]
[654.5133, "o", " return 2; }\r\r\n    if"]
[654.5332, "o", " (ioctl(master_fd, TIOCS"]
[654.5531, "o", "PTLCK"]
[654.5532, "o", ", 0) "]
[654.573, "o", "< 0) { perror(\"TIO"]
[654.5931, "o", "CSPTLCK\"); return 2"]
[654.613, "o", "; }\r\r\n    char slave"]
[654.6328, "o", "path["]
[654.6527, "o", "32];\r\r\n    snprintf"]
[654.6726, "o", "(slavepath, sizeof slavepath"]
[654.6925, "o", ", \"/dev/pts/%"]
[654.7124, "o", "d\", ptyn);\r\r\n   "]
[654.7323, "o", " int slave = open(slavepath,"]
[654.7522, "o", " O_RDWR | O_NOCTTY);"]
[654.7721, "o", "\r\r\n    if (slave < 0"]
[654.7919, "o", ") { perror(\"open slave\"); return"]
[654.8119, "o", " 2; }\r\r\n\r\r\n    pid_t"]
[654.8319, "o", " pid = fork();\r\r\n    if ("]
[654.8518, "o", "pid < 0) {"]
[654.8717, "o", " perror(\"fork\"); return 2;"]
[654.8915, "o", " }\r\r\n    if (pid == "]
[654.9114, "o", "0) {\r\r\n       "]
[654.9313, "o", " if (setsid"]
[654.9511, "o", "() < 0)"]
[654.9709, "o", " _exit("]
[654.9906, "o", "2);\r\r\n       "]
[655.0105, "o", " if (ioctl(slave, T"]
[655.0304, "o", "IOCSCTTY, 0)"]
[655.0503, "o", " < 0) _exit(2"]
[655.0702, "o", ");\r\r\n        dup2(slave,"]
[655.09, "o", " 0);\r\r\n        dup2(sl"]
[655.11, "o", "ave, 1);\r\r\n        dup"]
[655.1299, "o", "2(slave, 2);\r\r\n"]
[655.1498, "o", "        close"]
[655.1696, "o", "(master_fd);"]
[655.1894, "o", "\r\r\n        close(slave);\r\r\n       "]
[655.2093, "o", " exe"]
[655.229, "o", "cl(\"/generated/bin/sh\","]
[655.2488, "o", " \"sh\","]
[655.2686, "o", " (char *)"]
[655.2884, "o", "0);\r\r\n        _exit("]
[655.3083, "o", "127);\r\r\n    }"]
[655.3281, "o", "\r\r\n    close(slave);\r\r\n\r\r\n   "]
[655.3481, "o", " fprintf(stderr,"]
[655.3679, "o", " \"=== ptytest"]
[655.3877, "o", ": shell"]
[655.4075, "o", " started ("]
[655.4273, "o", "pid %d) ==="]
[655.4472, "o", "\\n\", ("]
[655.4671, "o", "int)pid);"]
[655.487, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n    /* Phase "]
[655.5068, "o", "0: banner + prompt */\r\r\n   "]
[655.5267, "o", " fprintf(stderr,"]
[655.5465, "o", " \"--- phase 0:"]
[655.5663, "o", " startup ---\\n\");\r\r\n    collect"]
[655.5863, "o", "("]
[655.606, "o", "800, \""]
[655.6258, "o", "startup\");\r\r\n\r\r\n    /* Phase 1"]
[655.6457, "o", ": simple command */\r\r\n    fprintf(stderr"]
[655.6656, "o", ","]
[655.6853, "o", " \"\\n--- phase 1:"]
[655.7051, "o", " 'ls /data' ---\\n"]
[655.725, "o", "\");\r\r\n    type(\"ls /data"]
[655.7449, "o", "\\n\");\r\r\n    collect("]
[655.7649, "o", "600, \""]
[655.7847, "o", "ls\");\r\r\n\r\r\n    /* Phase 2"]
[655.8046, "o", ":"]
[655.8243, "o", " 2-stage pipeline (the"]
[655.8442, "o", " dangerous"]
[655.8639, "o", " one) */\r\r\n    fprintf(stderr,"]
[655.8837, "o", " \"\\n--- phase 2: '"]
[655.9037, "o", "cat /"]
[655.9235, "o", "data/readme.txt | head -1"]
[655.9433, "o", "' ---\\n\");\r\r\n    type"]
[655.9632, "o", "(\"cat /data/readme.txt |"]
[655.9832, "o", " head -1\\n\");\r\r\n    collect"]
[656.0031, "o", "("]
[656.0228, "o", "800, \"pipeline\");\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[656.0427, "o", "    /* Phase 3:"]
[656.0627, "o", " is the shell still alive?"]
[656.0826, "o", " */\r\r\n    fprintf(stderr, \"\\n"]
[656.1024, "o", "--- phase 3: 'pwd"]
[656.1223, "o", "' ("]
[656.1421, "o", "must"]
[656.1618, "o", " answer"]
[656.1814, "o", " if shell"]
[656.2012, "o", " survived) ---\\n\");\r\r\n   "]
[656.2211, "o", " type(\"pwd\\n\");\r\r\n   "]
[656.2409, "o", " int"]
[656.2606, "o", " pwd_bytes = collect(600"]
[656.2805, "o", ", \"pwd\");\r\r\n\r\r\n    /* Phase"]
[656.3003, "o", " 4: exit */\r\r\n    fprintf"]
[656.3202, "o", "(stderr, \"\\n--- phase 4"]
[656.3401, "o", ": 'exit' ---\\n\");"]
[656.3601, "o", "\r\r\n    type(\"exit\\n\");\r\r\n"]
[656.3801, "o", "    collect(800, \""]
[656.4, "o", "exit\");\r\r\n\r\r\n    int"]
[656.4198, "o", " st;\r\r\n   "]
[656.4397, "o", " int"]
[656.4594, "o", " status = 0;\r\r\n    if"]
[656.4793, "o", " (waitpid(pid,"]
[656.4991, "o", " &status, 0)"]
[656.519, "o", " > 0) {\r\r\n       "]
[656.5388, "o", " if (WIFEXIT"]
[656.5586, "o", "ED(status)) {\r\r\n            fprintf"]
[656.5785, "o", "(stderr, \"\\nptytest: shell"]
[656.5984, "o", " exited with code %d\\n\","]
[656.6182, "o", " WEXITSTATUS(status));\r\r\n            status"]
[656.6383, "o", " = WEXITSTATUS(status);\r\r\n"]
[656.6581, "o", "        } else {\r\r\n            fprintf(stderr"]
[656.678, "o", ", \"\\nptytest: shell"]
[656.6979, "o", " killed by signal %d\\n\", W"]
[656.7178, "o", "TERMS"]
[656.7377, "o", "IG(status));\r\r\n            status ="]
[656.7575, "o", " 128"]
[656.7773, "o", " + WTERMSIG(status);\r\r\n"]
[656.7973, "o", "        }\r\r\n    } else {\r\r\n"]
[656.8173, "o", "        fprintf(stderr, \"\\"]
[656.8371, "o", "nptytest: shell still"]
[656.857, "o", " alive ("]
[656.8768, "o", "did not exit"]
[656.8966, "o", " on 'exit"]
[656.9164, "o", "'"]
[656.9362, "o", "??)\\n\");\r\r\n       "]
[656.9562, "o", " status = "]
[656.976, "o", "99;\r\r\n    }\r\r\n\r\r\n   "]
[656.996, "o", " if (pwd_bytes > 0"]
[657.0159, "o", " && status == 0)"]
[657.0358, "o", "\r\r\n        fprintf(stderr, \"PTY"]
[657.0556, "o", "TEST:"]
[657.0754, "o", " PASS \u2014 shell survived the"]
[657.0953, "o", " pipeline and"]
[657.1151, "o", " answered pwd\\n\");\r\r\n    else\r\r\n"]
[657.135, "o", "        fprintf(stderr, \"PTYTEST:"]
[657.1549, "o", " FAIL \u2014 pwd"]
[657.1747, "o", "_bytes=%d"]
[657.1945, "o", " shell"]
[657.2142, "o", "_status=%d\\n\", pwd_bytes,"]
[657.2341, "o", " status);\r\r\n    return"]
[657.2539, "o", " (pwd_bytes > 0 && status"]
[657.274, "o", " == 0) ? 0 :"]
[657.2939, "o", " 1;\r\r\n}\r\r\n```\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[657.3138, "o", "Wait \u2014 the"]
[657.3336, "o", " waitpid"]
[657.3534, "o", " after \"exit\":"]
[657.3732, "o", " the shell exits"]
[657.3931, "o", " \u2192 the slave"]
[657.4129, "o", " closes \u2192 the"]
[657.4327, "o", " master's read"]
[657.4525, "o", " gets EIO \u2192"]
[657.4723, "o", " collect"]
[657.492, "o", " returns"]
[657.5117, "o", " \u2192"]
[657.5313, "o", " then waitpid"]
[657.5511, "o", " reaps"]
[657.5709, "o", " it."]
[657.5907, "o", " But there's a"]
[657.6106, "o", " race: after the shell"]
[657.6304, "o", " exits,"]
[657.6502, "o", " if I"]
[657.67, "o", " waitpid"]
[657.6898, "o", " with"]
[657.7094, "o", " no timeout"]
[657.7293, "o", " it"]
[657.749, "o", " blocks until the shell"]
[657.7688, "o", " dies \u2014"]
[657.7886, "o", " the shell should"]
[657.8085, "o", " die on 'exit' ("]
[657.8284, "o", "clean)."]
[657.8483, "o", " OK. But if the"]
[657.8681, "o", " session is"]
[657.8879, "o", " killed"]
[657.9076, "o", " by the watcher, the shell"]
[657.9275, "o", " dies"]
[657.9472, "o", " earlier"]
[657.9669, "o", " ("]
[657.9866, "o", "before"]
[658.0062, "o", " the exit"]
[658.0261, "o", ")"]
[658.0458, "o", " \u2192"]
[658.0655, "o", " phase 3"]
[658.0854, "o", "'s collect gets"]
[658.1053, "o", " EIO"]
[658.1251, "o", ", pwd_bytes=0 \u2192"]
[658.1449, "o", " FAIL \u2192 then waitpid returns"]
[658.1648, "o", " the signal. Good.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[658.1847, "o", "Hmm, one"]
[658.2046, "o", " issue: `collect"]
[658.2244, "o", "`"]
[658.244, "o", " breaks"]
[658.2638, "o", " after"]
[658.2835, "o", " the first 50ms of"]
[658.3034, "o", " quiet \u2014"]
[658.3232, "o", " in"]
[658.3429, "o", " phase "]
[658.3627, "o", "2 (pipeline), the"]
[658.3825, "o", " output"]
[658.4022, "o", " arrives"]
[658.422, "o", " in a burst"]
[658.4419, "o", "; "]
[658.4618, "o", "800ms of"]
[658.4817, "o", " budget with a 5"]
[658.4817, "o", "0ms"]
[658.5015, "o", " quiet check"]
[658.5213, "o", " = it"]
[658.5412, "o", " returns when the"]
[658.561, "o", " output"]
[658.5807, "o", " settles"]
[658.6004, "o", ". Good.\r\r\n\r\r\nAnother"]
[658.6202, "o", " consideration: the"]
[658.64, "o", " pty's echo"]
[658.6598, "o", " \u2014"]
[658.6795, "o", " when I"]
[658.6994, "o", " write \"ls /data\\n\", the"]
[658.7192, "o", " pty echoes"]
[658.7391, "o", " it back ("]
[658.759, "o", "echo on)"]
[658.7788, "o", " \u2192 collect"]
[658.7986, "o", " also sees"]
[658.8184, "o", " the echoed"]
[658.8382, "o", " input. That's"]
[658.858, "o", " fine (it's"]
[658.8779, "o", " realistic"]
[658.8975, "o", "; the"]
[658.9173, "o", " real"]
[658.937, "o", " console"]
[658.9567, "o", " behaves the same way).\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[658.9766, "o", "Timing"]
[658.9963, "o", " concern:"]
[659.0163, "o", " the watcher's"]
[659.0362, "o", " grace"]
[659.056, "o", " period is"]
[659.0759, "o", " around 1"]
[659.0957, "o", "\u20135"]
[659.1155, "o", "ms"]
[659.1352, "o", " \u2014 but"]
[659.155, "o", " in"]
[659.1747, "o", " TTY mode,"]
[659.1946, "o", " is there a"]
[659.2144, "o", " per-line"]
[659.2343, "o", " feeder at all? The"]
[659.2541, "o", " whole"]
[659.2738, "o", " mechanism"]
[659.2935, "o", " I discovered"]
[659.3133, "o", " is about"]
[659.3331, "o", " the harness's"]
[659.3529, "o", " scripted"]
[659.3726, "o", " stdin feeder. In"]
[659.3925, "o", " a real tty session"]
[659.4124, "o", " ("]
[659.4321, "o", "and this"]
[659.4519, "o", " simulation),"]
[659.4717, "o", " input is"]
[659.4915, "o", " user-driven; the"]
[659.5114, "o", " feeder"]
[659.5311, "o", " shouldn't exist. But"]
[659.5509, "o", " the watcher might still be"]
[659.5707, "o", " watching exec"]
[659.5905, "o", " events and doing something to"]
[659.6103, "o", " the session (killing the"]
[659.6302, "o", " cgroup,"]
[659.6501, "o", " closing the pty, etc"]
[659.6701, "o", ".). ptytest will"]
[659.6899, "o", " reveal"]
[659.7096, "o", " that.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[659.7294, "o", "If ptytest"]
[659.7493, "o", " PASSES"]
[659.7691, "o", " \u2192 the interactive shell"]
[659.7889, "o", " is"]
[659.8086, "o", " safe \u2192 deliver it"]
[659.8284, "o", "."]
[659.8482, "o", " The"]
[659.8679, "o", " quirk in"]
[659.8877, "o", " capture mode is a"]
[659.9076, "o", " known"]
[659.9273, "o", " limitation"]
[659.9469, "o", " of scripted"]
[659.9667, "o", " input ("]
[659.9865, "o", "I'll"]
[660.0064, "o", " mention it in the"]
[660.0262, "o", " help"]
[660.0459, "o", "/summary"]
[660.0657, "o", ")."]
[660.0658, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nIf ptytest FAILS"]
[660.0856, "o", " \u2192 the tty"]
[660.1054, "o", " session is also"]
[660.1252, "o", " being"]
[660.1449, "o", " killed"]
[660.1646, "o", " on"]
[660.1842, "o", " pipeline completion \u2192 I need a"]
[660.2041, "o", " real fix ("]
[660.2239, "o", "in-process"]
[660.2438, "o", " stage /"]
[660.2635, "o", " ELF loader"]
[660.2835, "o", " / sequential execution"]
[660.3034, "o", " within a"]
[660.3234, "o", " grace period)"]
[660.3432, "o", " before delivery.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[660.3631, "o", "Now, let me"]
[660.3829, "o", " also"]
[660.4027, "o", " pick which shell to"]
[660.4225, "o", " test: the"]
[660.4424, "o", " current"]
[660.4621, "o", " /"]
[660.4818, "o", "generated/bin/sh (v2"]
[660.5017, "o", ", direct pipeline)."]
[660.5215, "o", " If"]
[660.5412, "o", " it"]
[660.5609, "o", " fails in tty mode"]
[660.5808, "o", ", I'll"]
[660.6006, "o", " test sh"]
[660.6205, "o", "2 (helper)"]
[660.6403, "o", " next \u2014"]
[660.6601, "o", " sh2's"]
[660.68, "o", " helper"]
[660.6997, "o", " design"]
[660.7194, "o", " might also"]
[660.7391, "o", " survive tty"]
[660.759, "o", " mode ("]
[660.7788, "o", "in tty mode"]
[660.7986, "o", " there's no feeder"]
[660.8184, "o", " to close"]
[660.8383, "o", "... but"]
[660.8581, "o", " if the watcher kills"]
[660.8779, "o", " on"]
[660.8976, "o", " \""]
[660.9174, "o", "not"]
[660.937, "o", "-last"]
[660.9568, "o", " child"]
[660.9766, "o", " process exit\", sh2"]
[660.9965, "o", " fails"]
[661.0164, "o", " the same way"]
[661.0362, "o", "; if"]
[661.056, "o", " the watcher only closes"]
[661.0758, "o", " the stdin feeder, sh2"]
[661.0957, "o", "..."]
[661.1155, "o", " the sh"]
[661.1353, "o", "2"]
[661.1549, "o", " test"]
[661.1747, "o", " in capture"]
[661.1945, "o", " failed"]
[661.2142, "o", " because of the"]
[661.2341, "o", " feeder. In tty"]
[661.2539, "o", " there's no feeder"]
[661.2737, "o", " \u2192"]
[661.2935, "o", " if"]
[661.3132, "o", " it's only about the feeder, the"]
[661.3331, "o", " watcher might be"]
[661.353, "o", " inactive"]
[661.3727, "o", " in tty mode"]
[661.3925, "o", ").\r\r\n\r\r\nBuilding"]
[661.4123, "o", " ptytest and running it"]
[661.4322, "o", " against /generated/bin/sh.\r\r\n"]
[661.4521, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n`/dev/"]
[661.472, "o", "ptmx` and `/dev/pts"]
[661.492, "o", "` are available"]
[661.5119, "o", "."]
[661.5317, "o", " Currently building a full interactive session"]
[661.5516, "o", " simulator"]
[661.5714, "o", " \u2014 it"]
[661.5912, "o", " spawns"]
[661.6109, "o", " the shell on"]
[661.6307, "o", " an actual pty and"]
[661.6506, "o", " \"types\" commands"]
[661.6704, "o", " the way a"]
[661.6902, "o", " user would"]
[661.71, "o", ":\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[666.3775, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  compile ptytest.c\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[666.4595, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0 sha256:4532ddbc63f9f998ac35a7ae0949cdce9f3d1ed13466904a2fe88cd503dd0743\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[668.9127, "o", "\u001b[2mRun ptytest against the current shell"]
[668.9327, "o", " (/generated/bin/sh"]
[668.9526, "o", " = v2 direct pipeline):\r\r\n"]
[668.9728, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[669.1121, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/ptytest\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[669.1914, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=2\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[669.4088, "o", "\u001b[2mTIOCSPTLCK failed with"]
[669.4288, "o", " \"Bad address"]
[669.4488, "o", "\" \u2014"]
[669.4687, "o", " I passed"]
[669.4885, "o", " 0 as a pointer argument"]
[669.5084, "o", "."]
[669.5281, "o", " TIOCSPTLCK expects"]
[669.548, "o", " a pointer to int (the"]
[669.5679, "o", " lock state)."]
[669.5878, "o", " `ioctl(master_fd, TIOCS"]
[669.6077, "o", "PTLCK, 0)` \u2014"]
[669.6277, "o", " passing 0"]
[669.6475, "o", " means"]
[669.6673, "o", " a"]
[669.687, "o", " NULL pointer \u2192 E"]
[669.7068, "o", "FAULT."]
[669.7267, "o", " Should"]
[669.7464, "o", " pass"]
[669.7662, "o", " a pointer: `int"]
[669.7861, "o", " zero = 0; ioctl(master_fd"]
[669.8061, "o", ", TIOCSPTLCK,"]
[669.826, "o", " &zero);"]
[669.8458, "o", "`\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[669.8658, "o", "But wait \u2014 in"]
[669.8858, "o", " this"]
[669.9056, "o", " container,"]
[669.9254, "o", " /dev/"]
[669.9452, "o", "pt"]
[669.965, "o", "mx"]
[669.9847, "o", " might"]
[670.0044, "o", " be a"]
[670.0243, "o", " FUSE"]
[670.0441, "o", "/"]
[670.0639, "o", "9"]
[670.0836, "o", "p"]
[670.1033, "o", " passthrough, or the"]
[670.1232, "o", " pty"]
[670.1429, "o", " layer might"]
[670.1628, "o", " be restricted"]
[670.1826, "o", "..."]
[670.2024, "o", " let me"]
[670.2222, "o", " fix the"]
[670.242, "o", " code and"]
[670.2619, "o", " retry. If"]
[670.2817, "o", " TIO"]
[670.3016, "o", "CGPTN"]
[670.3214, "o", " worked"]
[670.3411, "o", " ("]
[670.3608, "o", "it"]
[670.3806, "o", " did \u2014"]
[670.4004, "o", " the error"]
[670.4202, "o", " occurred at TIOCSPTLCK"]
[670.4401, "o", ", which"]
[670.46, "o", " comes after TIOCGPTN),"]
[670.4799, "o", " then pt"]
[670.4997, "o", "mx is"]
[670.5196, "o", " functional.\r\r\n\r\r\nFix:"]
[670.5394, "o", " `int lock = 0; ioctl"]
[670.5595, "o", "(master_fd, TIOCSPTL"]
[670.5794, "o", "CK, &lock);`\r\r\n"]
[670.5994, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n`TIOCSPTLCK"]
[670.6194, "o", "` needs a pointer"]
[670.6393, "o", ", not"]
[670.6592, "o", " 0. Fixing:"]
[670.6592, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[674.2781, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  compile ptytest.c\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[674.3528, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0 sha256:3de8b866eac442d9581640550bd23f2868ada233a4893807dbdf310c844d0ca1\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[675.5385, "o", "\u001b[2mThe user"]
[675.5583, "o", " has sent the same"]
[675.5782, "o", " message for"]
[675.5982, "o", " the "]
[675.6181, "o", "3rd time"]
[675.638, "o", " \u2014 they're"]
[675.6579, "o", " waiting for the shell. Let me run"]
[675.6779, "o", " ptytest"]
[675.6978, "o", " right now, and"]
[675.7177, "o", " if it passes,"]
[675.7377, "o", " deliver the shell"]
[675.7576, "o", " in tty mode. If it"]
[675.7775, "o", " fails, I"]
[675.7974, "o", " need a"]
[675.8173, "o", " fix.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[675.8372, "o", "Running ptytest against the current"]
[675.8571, "o", " /generated/bin/sh (v2 direct"]
[675.8771, "o", " pipeline).\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[675.9972, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/ptytest\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[706.0795, "o", "\u001b[2m    timeout after 30s, killed; signal=9\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[706.4344, "o", "\u001b[2mptytest"]
[706.4541, "o", " results"]
[706.4737, "o", " \u2014 this is"]
[706.4737, "o", " the"]
[706.4935, "o", " decisive"]
[706.5131, "o", " test"]
[706.5328, "o", ", and it's"]
[706.5527, "o", " bad"]
[706.5725, "o", " news"]
[706.5923, "o", " for"]
[706.6121, "o", " the current shell"]
[706.6319, "o", " design:\r\r\n\r\r\n- Phase 0:"]
[706.6518, "o", " banner + prompt"]
[706.6715, "o", " \u2713\r\r\n- Phase 1: `"]
[706.6915, "o", "ls /data`"]
[706.7113, "o", " worked,"]
[706.731, "o", " output was"]
[706.7508, "o", " displayed, new prompt \u2713\r\r\n- Phase"]
[706.7707, "o", " 2: `cat /"]
[706.7905, "o", "data/readme.txt | head -1"]
[706.8104, "o", "` \u2014"]
[706.8302, "o", " output \"hello from the user's"]
[706.8303, "o", " data"]
[706.8501, "o", "\" was displayed, but **no new"]
[706.8699, "o", " prompt appeared"]
[706.8897, "o", "**!\r\r\n- Phase 3: `"]
[706.9096, "o", "pwd` \u2014 the"]
[706.9295, "o", " typed \"pwd"]
[706.9494, "o", "\\n\" was echoed, but"]
[706.9693, "o", " there was no"]
[706.9891, "o", " response from the"]
[707.0089, "o", " shell (no output"]
[707.0287, "o", ", no prompt).\r\r\n- Phase "]
[707.0486, "o", "4: `exit` \u2014"]
[707.0685, "o", " it was echoed, but"]
[707.0883, "o", " the shell didn't"]
[707.1082, "o", " exit"]
[707.1278, "o", "! The"]
[707.1477, "o", " test"]
[707.1673, "o", " had to"]
[707.1872, "o", " be killed at 30 seconds."]
[707.2071, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nIn other words"]
[707.2269, "o", ", in interactive"]
[707.2468, "o", " TTY mode"]
[707.2666, "o", ", the shell"]
[707.2865, "o", " died"]
[707.3061, "o", " (or was"]
[707.326, "o", " killed /"]
[707.3458, "o", " had its input"]
[707.3657, "o", " severed) after"]
[707.3856, "o", " the pipeline. The shell"]
[707.4055, "o", " process didn't"]
[707.4253, "o", " exit"]
[707.445, "o", " on 'exit' ("]
[707.4648, "o", "ptytest"]
[707.4847, "o", " had to"]
[707.5045, "o", " SIGKILL it) \u2014"]
[707.5244, "o", " so the shell"]
[707.5442, "o", " is still alive, but"]
[707.564, "o", " it stopped"]
[707.5839, "o", " processing"]
[707.6036, "o", " input"]
[707.6234, "o", " \u2014 either"]
[707.6432, "o", " its stdin"]
[707.6631, "o", " read"]
[707.6829, "o", " is broken"]
[707.7029, "o", ", or"]
[707.7228, "o", " it's"]
[707.7427, "o", " stuck in"]
[707.7626, "o", " waitpid, or"]
[707.7825, "o", " the p"]
[707.8025, "o", "ty"]
[707.8222, "o", " input was severed.\r\r\n\r\r\nWait"]
[707.8421, "o", " \u2014 actually,"]
[707.8621, "o", " \""]
[707.8818, "o", "the shell"]
[707.9017, "o", " didn't exit"]
[707.9216, "o", " on 'exit'\" means"]
[707.9414, "o", " one of the following"]
[707.9415, "o", ":"]
[707.9613, "o", "\r\r\n1. The shell's"]
[707.9813, "o", " read"]
[708.0011, "o", " of"]
[708.0209, "o", " 'exit"]
[708.0408, "o", "\\n' never"]
[708.0607, "o", " happened (the"]
[708.0805, "o", " input"]
[708.1002, "o", " channel was severed"]
[708.12, "o", " / the"]
[708.1399, "o", " shell"]
[708.1597, "o", " isn't reading),"]
[708.1796, "o", " or\r\r\n2. The shell is"]
[708.1996, "o", " blocked"]
[708.2194, "o", " on waitpid"]
[708.2392, "o", " for a pipeline"]
