[796.5442, "o", " cat (with arguments) doesn't read"]
[796.5647, "o", " stdin! So"]
[796.5852, "o", " the deadlock"]
[796.6057, "o", " requires the"]
[796.6262, "o", " proxy"]
[796.6467, "o", " to"]
[796.6671, "o", " read fd 0 regardless of"]
[796.6876, "o", " arguments."]
[796.7081, "o", " That's"]
[796.7285, "o", " a"]
[796.7489, "o", " property of the"]
[796.7693, "o", " sandbox's proxy, not my"]
[796.7898, "o", " code.\r\r\n\r\r\nHmm"]
[796.8103, "o", ", wait"]
[796.8307, "o", " \u2014 actually, let me reconsider."]
[796.8512, "o", " What if"]
[796.8716, "o", " it's"]
[796.8921, "o", " simpler"]
[796.9124, "o", ": what if the supervisor"]
[796.933, "o", " re-wires fd 0"]
[796.9535, "o", " for all child processes"]
[796.974, "o", " to"]
[796.9943, "o", " its own"]
[797.0147, "o", " input pipe"]
[797.0352, "o", " (bridged to the pty"]
[797.0353, "o", " in"]
[797.0557, "o", " tty mode), and"]
[797.0762, "o", " my"]
[797.0965, "o", " stage-0"]
[797.117, "o", " child process's cat"]
[797.1375, "o", "\u2026"]
[797.1578, "o", " still doesn't read fd 0"]
[797.1785, "o", " (it has"]
[797.1989, "o", " file arguments)."]
[797.2194, "o", " So"]
[797.2397, "o", " cat shouldn't"]
[797.2601, "o", " block"]
[797.2804, "o", " in read(0"]
[797.3009, "o", ")!!!\r\r\n\r\r\nUnless the cat"]
[797.3214, "o", " that ran is not my"]
[797.3418, "o", " /generated/bin/cat"]
[797.3623, "o", "! What if"]
[797.3828, "o", " execv"]
[797.4033, "o", "(\"/generated/bin/cat"]
[797.4238, "o", "\","]
[797.4442, "o", " ...)"]
[797.4645, "o", " \u2014"]
[797.4848, "o", " and the"]
[797.5052, "o", " supervisor's"]
[797.5257, "o", " seccomp"]
[797.5462, "o", "-redirect"]
[797.5666, "o", " sends it to a different cat"]
[797.5871, "o", " (the proxy"]
[797.6076, "o", ")"]
[797.6279, "o", " whose behavior"]
[797.6483, "o", " differs"]
[797.6686, "o", " from"]
[797.6889, "o", " mine"]
[797.7093, "o", " (the proxy"]
[797.7298, "o", " cat reads fd 0 first"]
[797.7503, "o", " \u2014 e.g"]
[797.7707, "o", ". the proxy"]
[797.7914, "o", " implements"]
[797.8118, "o", " `cat`"]
[797.8323, "o", " naively:"]
[797.8528, "o", " always reads stdin,"]
[797.8733, "o", " then the files?!"]
[797.8937, "o", ").\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[797.9141, "o", "I can test"]
[797.9346, "o", " this"]
[797.9549, "o", " hypothesis directly:"]
[797.9754, "o", " from"]
[797.9957, "o", " inside the shell, run a"]
[798.0162, "o", " simple"]
[798.0366, "o", " exec that reads"]
[798.057, "o", " fd 0, and"]
[798.0775, "o", " see what"]
[798.0979, "o", " it"]
[798.1182, "o", " gets."]
[798.1387, "o", " E.g. in a"]
[798.1592, "o", " TTY session ("]
[798.1797, "o", "pty"]
[798.2, "o", "test"]
[798.2203, "o", "-style): run `"]
[798.2408, "o", "head"]
[798.2612, "o", " -1`"]
[798.2817, "o", " alone (no"]
[798.3021, "o", " pipe) \u2014"]
[798.3225, "o", " my head"]
[798.3429, "o", " with no arguments reads fd 0"]
[798.3635, "o", " (stdin"]
[798.3839, "o", " ="]
[798.4043, "o", " pty) \u2192 the"]
[798.4248, "o", " user types"]
[798.4454, "o", " a line \u2192"]
[798.4658, "o", " head outputs it. If the"]
[798.4863, "o", " supervisor"]
[798.5066, "o", " bridges pty"]
[798.5271, "o", " input"]
[798.5475, "o", " to the child process's fd 0"]
[798.568, "o", ", head would"]
[798.5885, "o", " receive the typed line \u2192"]
[798.609, "o", " works. If the supervisor"]
[798.6294, "o", " feeds nothing"]
[798.6499, "o", " \u2192 head blocks"]
[798.6703, "o", ".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[798.6908, "o", "Even simpler:"]
[798.7112, "o", " `cat"]
[798.7316, "o", "` alone"]
[798.7521, "o", " in a TTY session"]
[798.7726, "o", ":"]
[798.7929, "o", " type"]
[798.8132, "o", " \"hello"]
[798.8336, "o", "\\n\" \u2192"]
[798.8541, "o", " does cat"]
[798.8746, "o", " echo it"]
[798.895, "o", " back?"]
[798.9154, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[798.9358, "o", "And the"]
[798.9563, "o", " decisive test"]
[798.9768, "o", " for the pipeline deadlock: in a"]
[798.9972, "o", " TTY session,"]
[799.0178, "o", " `cat | head -"]
[799.0383, "o", "1`"]
[799.0588, "o", " where cat"]
[799.0792, "o", "'s stdin is the pty"]
[799.0998, "o", ": cat"]
[799.1202, "o", " ("]
[799.1405, "o", "proxy"]
[799.1609, "o", "?)"]
[799.1812, "o", " blocks on read"]
[799.2016, "o", "(fd 0) \u2014"]
[799.2221, "o", " no"]
[799.2424, "o", " one types"]
[799.2629, "o", " \u2192"]
[799.2832, "o", " deadlock. But"]
[799.3037, "o", " `cat /"]
[799.3242, "o", "data/readme.txt | head -1"]
[799.3447, "o", "`"]
[799.365, "o", " \u2014"]
[799.3854, "o", " if the proxy cat"]
[799.4059, "o", " ignores arguments"]
[799.4263, "o", " and"]
[799.4466, "o", " reads fd 0"]
[799.4671, "o", " first \u2192"]
[799.4875, "o", " the same deadlock"]
[799.508, "o", " (matches the"]
[799.5284, "o", " observation!)."]
[799.5489, "o", " If"]
[799.5692, "o", " it"]
[799.5896, "o", "'s my"]
[799.61, "o", " real cat,"]
[799.6305, "o", " no deadlock.\r\r\n\r\r\nSo the"]
[799.6511, "o", " question is: does the"]
[799.6717, "o", " sandbox replace the"]
[799.6921, "o", " exec of"]
[799.7125, "o", " /generated/bin/cat with a proxy"]
[799.7331, "o", "?"]
[799.7534, "o", " How to"]
[799.7738, "o", " check"]
[799.7942, "o", ":"]
[799.8145, "o", " have the child"]
[799.835, "o", " process print"]
[799.8554, "o", " which"]
[799.8757, "o", " binary it"]
[799.8962, "o", " is"]
[799.9166, "o", "\u2026"]
[799.9369, "o", " I can"]
[799.9574, "o", " build a test"]
[799.9779, "o", " program"]
[799.9982, "o", " `"]
[800.0186, "o", "wh"]
[800.0389, "o", "oc"]
[800.0593, "o", "ares` that"]
[800.0797, "o", " prints"]
[800.1001, "o", " argv"]
[800.1205, "o", "[0] and its own"]
[800.1409, "o", " /proc"]
[800.1613, "o", "/self/ex"]
[800.1818, "o", "e readlink! If"]
[800.2023, "o", " I"]
[800.2227, "o", " exec it in"]
[800.2431, "o", " a pipeline"]
[800.2636, "o", " stage,"]
[800.284, "o", " /proc/self"]
[800.3045, "o", "/exe"]
[800.3249, "o", " will"]
[800.3453, "o", " reveal"]
[800.3656, "o", " whether"]
[800.3859, "o", " I"]
[800.4063, "o", " really am my"]
[800.4267, "o", " own binary"]
[800.4472, "o", " or the proxy"]
[800.4678, "o", "!\r\r\n\r\r\nLet me"]
[800.4884, "o", " design"]
[800.5088, "o", " a TTY test"]
[800.5293, "o", " (ptytest v2):\r\r\n"]
[800.5498, "o", "- Phase"]
[800.5703, "o", " A: `"]
[800.5907, "o", "whocares`"]
