[805.2487, "o", " that completes?\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[805.2693, "o", "If"]
[805.2897, "o", " pty input is bridged"]
[805.3103, "o", " to"]
[805.3307, "o", " the child"]
[805.3513, "o", " processes' stdin and the"]
[805.3719, "o", " binary is"]
[805.3924, "o", " the real one, then"]
[805.413, "o", " the"]
[805.4334, "o", " earlier hang (cat"]
[805.454, "o", " | head) should"]
[805.4746, "o", " have completed\u2026 but"]
[805.4952, "o", " it didn't (cat was"]
[805.5158, "o", " blocked in read(0"]
[805.5364, "o", ") \u2014"]
[805.557, "o", " a"]
[805.5774, "o", " cat with file arguments should never read"]
[805.598, "o", " fd 0"]
[805.6187, "o", " \u2014"]
[805.6392, "o", " so"]
[805.6597, "o", " either cat"]
[805.6804, "o", " wasn't my cat, or the proxy"]
[805.701, "o", " is different)."]
[805.7216, "o", " whocares's"]
[805.7422, "o", " /proc/self/exe output will"]
[805.7628, "o", " settle"]
[805.7833, "o", " the \""]
[805.8039, "o", "proxy\" question"]
[805.8244, "o", " definitively.\r\r\n\r\r\nLet me build"]
[805.8451, "o", " whocares"]
[805.8657, "o", " + ptytest"]
[805.8863, "o", "2 and run it.\r\r\n\r\r\nActually,"]
[805.907, "o", " I"]
[805.9275, "o", " also want"]
[805.948, "o", " the"]
[805.9684, "o", " shell's own"]
[805.989, "o", " view"]
[806.0094, "o", ":"]
[806.0298, "o", " does the shell"]
[806.0504, "o", " (the spawned program"]
