[806.1529, "o", "fd 0 ="]
[806.1736, "o", " pty slave), or does the supervisor"]
[806.1943, "o", " re-wire"]
[806.2149, "o", " even the"]
[806.2355, "o", " spawned program's fd 0?"]
[806.2561, "o", " From"]
[806.2765, "o", " ptytest"]
[806.2971, "o", " phase "]
[806.3176, "o", "0-1: the shell"]
[806.3382, "o", " read"]
[806.3587, "o", " commands I typed (the"]
[806.3793, "o", " ls /data"]
[806.3998, "o", " line"]
[806.4203, "o", " reached the shell"]
[806.4409, "o", "'s"]
[806.4613, "o", " read"]
[806.4818, "o", "_line"]
[806.5022, "o", " \u2014"]
[806.5226, "o", " I typed it"]
[806.5432, "o", " into the pty"]
[806.5638, "o", " master"]
[806.5842, "o", " and"]
[806.6046, "o", " the shell processed it) \u2192 the shell"]
[806.6253, "o", "'s fd 0 is"]
[806.6459, "o", " really the pty"]
[806.6665, "o", " slave ("]
[806.6871, "o", "at least the"]
[806.7076, "o", " input"]
[806.728, "o", " path is"]
[806.7486, "o", " bridged"]
[806.7691, "o", "\u2026"]
[806.7896, "o", " or"]
[806.8101, "o", " direct)."]
[806.8307, "o", " The shell"]
[806.8514, "o", " is working."]
[806.872, "o", " So"]
[806.8924, "o", " the"]
[806.9128, "o", " re-wiring"]
[806.9334, "o", " (if any)"]
[806.9539, "o", " applies to the child processes'"]
[806.9744, "o", " fd 0"]
[806.9949, "o", " ("]
[807.0153, "o", "the supervisor"]
[807.0357, "o", " intercepts the"]
[807.0562, "o", " child"]
[807.0765, "o", " processes' exec).\r\r\n\r\r\nHmm"]
[807.0971, "o", " wait,"]
[807.1176, "o", " actually \u2014"]
[807.1382, "o", " another"]
[807.1587, "o", " theory for the"]
[807.1792, "o", " cat"]
[807.1997, "o", " mystery that"]
[807.2203, "o", " doesn't"]
[807.2408, "o", " require a proxy:"]
[807.2614, "o", " what if the supervisor re-w"]
[807.282, "o", "ires the child process's fd 0"]
[807.3026, "o", " to a supervisor"]
[807.3231, "o", " input pipe, and also the"]
[807.3436, "o", " supervisor's"]
[807.3641, "o", " seccomp"]
[807.3845, "o", " filter"]
[807.4049, "o", " blocks"]
[807.4254, "o", "/"]
[807.4458, "o", "intercepts the"]
[807.4665, "o", " child process's open()"]
[807.4869, "o", " syscall on"]
[807.5074, "o", " /data/readme.txt"]
[807.5279, "o", " ("]
[807.5483, "o", "returning"]
[807.5687, "o", " -"]
[807.5891, "o", "EACC"]
[807.6097, "o", "ES"]
[807.6301, "o", "?), so my cat's"]
[807.6506, "o", " open"]
[807.6709, "o", " fails \u2192"]
[807.6914, "o", " my cat"]
[807.7119, "o", " prints an error and"]
[807.7324, "o", " exits\u2026"]
[807.7529, "o", " no"]
[807.7733, "o", ", then it"]
[807.7938, "o", " would"]
[807.8142, "o", " have exited.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[807.8347, "o", "Or"]
[807.855, "o", " the supervisor's"]
[807.8755, "o", " seccomp makes the child process's"]
[807.8961, "o", " open()"]
[807.9166, "o", " block (a"]
[807.9371, "o", " SECCOMP"]
[807.9576, "o", "_RET"]
[807.9779, "o", "_TRACE with a"]
[807.9984, "o", " slow"]
[808.0188, "o", "/no"]
[808.0392, "o", " handler"]
[808.0596, "o", ") \u2192 cat"]
[808.08, "o", " blocks in open"]
[808.1006, "o", ", not read(0). But"]
[808.1212, "o", " /proc"]
[808.1418, "o", "/syscall"]
[808.1623, "o", " clearly"]
[808.1826, "o", " shows read(0)."]
[808.2032, "o", " So"]
[808.2235, "o", " cat"]
[808.244, "o", " really"]
[808.2643, "o", " is executing"]
[808.2848, "o", " read(0) \u2014"]
[808.3053, "o", " a code"]
[808.3259, "o", " path that"]
[808.3463, "o", " reads fd 0"]
[808.3669, "o", " \u2014"]
[808.3873, "o", " which my cat ("]
[808.4078, "o", "with"]
[808.4282, "o", " arguments)"]
[808.4487, "o", " never"]
[808.469, "o", " executes."]
[808.4895, "o", " \u21d2"]
[808.5099, "o", " The"]
[808.5302, "o", " running"]
[808.5506, "o", " code is not my cat"]
[808.5711, "o", " \u21d2"]
[808.5915, "o", " the sandbox"]
[808.612, "o", " substituted"]
[808.6324, "o", " the binary (or"]
[808.6529, "o", " the code"]
[808.6734, "o", ") for the"]
[808.6939, "o", " child process.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[808.7144, "o", "Actually"]
[808.7348, "o", " hmm,"]
[808.7553, "o", " wait \u2014"]
[808.7757, "o", " one more"]
[808.7962, "o", ": what if"]
[808.8167, "o", " execv"]
[808.8372, "o", " inside the child process"]
[808.8577, "o", " was blocked"]
[808.8783, "o", " (seccomp"]
[808.899, "o", " E"]
[808.9194, "o", "PERM on"]
[808.94, "o", " exec"]
[808.9603, "o", "ve for the child"]
[808.9808, "o", " process"]
[809.0012, "o", "?),"]
[809.0216, "o", " my"]
[809.042, "o", " child"]
[809.0624, "o", "_run's"]
[809.0829, "o", " `execv`"]
[809.1034, "o", " returned -1,"]
[809.1239, "o", " the"]
[809.1443, "o", " child"]
[809.1647, "o", " process printed \""]
[809.1852, "o", "sh: /generated/bin"]
[809.2058, "o", "/cat:"]
[809.2263, "o", " ...\""]
[809.2466, "o", " to stderr"]
[809.2671, "o", ", and"]
[809.2876, "o", " exit(1"]
[809.308, "o", "26) \u2192"]
[809.3286, "o", " it exited\u2026"]
[809.3491, "o", " no, it"]
[809.3696, "o", "'s still"]
[809.39, "o", " alive.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[809.4106, "o", "Or"]
[809.431, "o", " the child process"]
[809.4515, "o", "'s execve"]
[809.472, "o", " succeeded but"]
[809.4924, "o", " loaded the"]
[809.5129, "o", " wrong"]
[809.5333, "o", " ELF"]
[809.5538, "o", " (the supervisor"]
[809.5743, "o", " swapped the"]
[809.5948, "o", " file"]
[809.6152, "o", " contents?)"]
[809.6356, "o", " \u2014 /"]
[809.6563, "o", "generated/bin/cat"]
[809.6769, "o", " is a symlink to the"]
[809.6973, "o", " /store hash"]
[809.7178, "o", " \u2014 if the"]
[809.7383, "o", " supervisor served"]
[809.7588, "o", " a different"]
[809.7794, "o", " ELF for the hash"]
[809.7999, "o", "\u2026"]
[809.8203, "o", " the"]
[809.8407, "o", " running code"]
[809.8612, "o", " ="]
[809.8815, "o", " the supervisor's cat"]
[809.9021, "o", " proxy that reads"]
[809.9226, "o", " stdin first."]
[809.943, "o", " Same conclusion"]
[809.9635, "o", ": the sandbox"]
[809.9841, "o", " mediates the"]
[810.0047, "o", " child process's"]
[810.0252, "o", " binary.\r\r\n\r\r\nOK"]
[810.0458, "o", " \u2014 building whocares"]
[810.0663, "o", " + ptytest2."]
[810.0869, "o", " This"]
[810.1073, "o", " will tell me the"]
[810.1278, "o", " ground truth"]
[810.1482, "o", " about what"]
[810.1687, "o", " runs in the child"]
[810.1892, "o", " processes and whether pty input is"]
[810.2098, "o", " bridged to them.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[810.2304, "o", "One more"]
[810.251, "o", " check"]
[810.2714, "o", " I"]
[810.2918, "o", " can"]
[810.3122, "o", " do"]
[810.3326, "o", " right now"]
[810.353, "o", " (without"]
[810.3735, "o", " a new"]
[810.394, "o", " build):"]
[810.4145, "o", " read the"]
[810.435, "o", " stuck"]
[810.4554, "o", " cat's /proc"]
[810.4759, "o", "/3"]
[810.4964, "o", "55"]
[810.5169, "o", "9"]
[810.5373, "o", "2"]
[810.5576, "o", "97"]
[810.5781, "o", "/maps \u2014 the"]
[810.5985, "o", " memory map"]
[810.619, "o", " shows which ELF"]
[810.6395, "o", " segments are loaded! If the"]
[810.6601, "o", " loaded image is"]
[810.6806, "o", " my cat (the"]
[810.7011, "o", " /store"]
[810.7216, "o", " hash file"]
[810.7421, "o", "),"]
[810.7624, "o", " it's my"]
[810.7829, "o", " code; if it's"]
[810.8034, "o", " some other file, it's"]
[810.824, "o", " the proxy. Let me"]
[810.8446, "o", " read the maps"]
[810.8651, "o", " of the stuck cat"]
[810.8857, "o", " and head"]
[810.9064, "o", " right now!"]
[810.927, "o", " (The background"]
[810.9475, "o", " ptytest is still running"]
[810.9681, "o", " \u2014 the"]
[810.9886, "o", " processes are still alive"]
[811.0092, "o", "!)\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[811.0297, "o", "Both"]
[811.0501, "o", " child processes are"]
[811.0706, "o", " blocked on `read(fd 0)`"]
[811.0912, "o", " \u2014 but `cat`"]
[811.1117, "o", " was given"]
[811.1322, "o", " a *file argument"]
[811.1527, "o", "*, and"]
[811.1732, "o", " my"]
[811.1936, "o", " `cat` never"]
[811.2141, "o", " touches"]
[811.2345, "o", " fd 0 in that case."]
[811.255, "o", " Something else is running in"]
[811.2756, "o", " those"]
[811.2959, "o", " processes."]
[811.3165, "o", " The memory map will"]
[811.337, "o", " reveal what"]
[811.3575, "o", " ELF was actually loaded:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[811.5429, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[811.6667, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  read path=/proc/3559297/maps len=1200\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[811.6668, "o", "\u001b[2m  read path=/proc/3559298/maps len=1200\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[816.409, "o", "\u001b[2mThe maps are"]
[816.4295, "o", " revealing:"]
[816.4501, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n-"]
[816.4706, "o", " cat"]
[816.491, "o", " process (355929"]
[816.5117, "o", "7):"]
[816.5321, "o", " the loaded image"]
[816.5527, "o", " = `.../"]
[816.5732, "o", "store/sha256:8"]
[816.5939, "o", "dfbd4caa951ee"]
[816.6146, "o", "9dfaf44f"]
[816.6352, "o", "15c532"]
[816.6558, "o", "7ad9d8e"]
[816.6764, "o", "2af29be0"]
[816.6971, "o", "7a5a9e44"]
[816.7178, "o", "faac756"]
[816.7384, "o", "fa754c/bin`"]
[816.7591, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[816.7796, "o", "- head process (355"]
