[926.2251, "o", " dup2"]
[926.2461, "o", "...` \u2014"]
[926.2672, "o", " stage 0 has prev"]
[926.2882, "o", "==-1)."]
[926.3091, "o", " Add the"]
[926.33, "o", " /dev/null block"]
[926.351, "o", " conditioned on `prev < 0`"]
[926.372, "o", " \u2014 but"]
[926.3929, "o", " note"]
[926.4137, "o", ": in the nseg"]
[926.4345, "o", "==1 case,"]
[926.4555, "o", " the"]
[926.4763, "o", " child is also"]
[926.4972, "o", " spawned"]
[926.518, "o", " through"]
[926.5388, "o", " the"]
[926.5596, "o", " same code path"]
[926.5806, "o", " with prev=-1"]
[926.6015, "o", "!! The n"]
[926.6225, "o", "seg==1"]
[926.6434, "o", " child must not"]
[926.6643, "o", " get /dev/null!"]
[926.6852, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nLet me"]
[926.7062, "o", " re"]
[926.727, "o", "-check the"]
[926.7479, "o", " v2"]
[926.7688, "o", " run_pipeline structure:"]
[926.7898, "o", " it's a single loop"]
[926.8107, "o", " over"]
[926.8315, "o", " segments"]
[926.8523, "o", ";"]
[926.8732, "o", " nseg==1"]
[926.8943, "o", " \u2192 one"]
[926.9153, "o", " child, prev=-1, pfd"]
[926.9363, "o", "=-1."]
[926.9573, "o", " nseg"]
[926.9782, "o", "==2 \u2192"]
[926.9991, "o", " child 0"]
[927.0201, "o", " (prev=-1), child 1"]
[927.0411, "o", " (prev="]
[927.062, "o", "pipe). So the"]
[927.0831, "o", " condition"]
[927.1039, "o", " \"prev < 0\" is"]
[927.1249, "o", " true for both the single"]
[927.1459, "o", "-command child and"]
[927.1668, "o", " the pipeline"]
[927.1878, "o", "'s stage 0"]
[927.2087, "o", ". I need"]
[927.2297, "o", " to"]
[927.2506, "o", " distinguish:"]
[927.2715, "o", " pass"]
[927.2923, "o", " an"]
[927.3131, "o", " `is"]
[927.3341, "o", "_pipeline"]
[927.3549, "o", " = (nseg > 1"]
[927.3759, "o", ")` flag to the child code:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[927.3971, "o", "```c\r\r\nif ("]
[927.4183, "o", "pid == 0"]
[927.4393, "o", ") {\r\r\n   "]
[927.4604, "o", " ..."]
[927.4813, "o", " dup2"]
[927.5023, "o", " stuff ...\r\r\n    if ("]
[927.5235, "o", "is_pipeline && prev < 0)"]
[927.5446, "o", " {\r\r\n       "]
[927.5656, "o", " int dn = open(\"/dev/null\","]
[927.5867, "o", " O_RDWR);\r\r\n        if (dn"]
[927.6078, "o", " >= 0) { dup2(d"]
[927.6289, "o", "n, STDIN_FILENO); if"]
[927.629, "o", " ("]
[927.65, "o", "dn > 2) close(dn"]
[927.6711, "o", "); }\r\r\n    }\r\r\n    child"]
[927.6921, "o", "_run(...);\r\r\n}\r\r\n```\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[927.7132, "o", "Good"]
[927.7342, "o", ". Let me"]
[927.7551, "o", " write the full source"]
[927.7761, "o", " for"]
[927.7969, "o", " the fixed"]
[927.797, "o", " sh (v2"]
[927.818, "o", " + this patch). Also"]
[927.839, "o", " update the help text to"]
[927.86, "o", " mention the pipeline"]
[927.881, "o", " stdin limitation?"]
[927.9021, "o", " Keep"]
[927.923, "o", " help"]
[927.9439, "o", " concise \u2014"]
[927.9649, "o", " add a"]
[927.986, "o", " line: \""]
[928.0069, "o", "Pipelines: stage "]
[928.028, "o", "1"]
[928.0489, "o", "'s stdin"]
[928.0699, "o", " is /dev/null ("]
[928.0909, "o", "run"]
[928.1118, "o", " pagers"]
[928.1328, "o", " standalone)\".\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[928.1538, "o", "After that"]
[928.1749, "o", ":"]
[928.1957, "o", " rebuild sh, re"]
[928.2168, "o", "-run ptytest"]
[928.2379, "o", " (expecting"]
[928.2589, "o", " PASS), re-run the capture"]
[928.2799, "o", " smoke test ("]
[928.301, "o", "the multi-line"]
[928.3221, "o", " capture with a pipeline"]
[928.343, "o", " \u2014 expect lines"]
[928.3639, "o", " after the"]
[928.3849, "o", " 2-stage pipeline to be lost \u2014"]
[928.4059, "o", " a documented limitation"]
[928.4269, "o", "), and then"]
[928.4478, "o", " finally launch the shell"]
[928.4688, "o", " in"]
[928.4897, "o", " tty mode for the user.\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[928.5107, "o", "Actually, let"]
[928.5317, "o", " me"]
[928.5525, "o", " reconsider"]
[928.5734, "o", " whether to"]
[928.5943, "o", " also"]
[928.6151, "o", " add"]
[928.636, "o", " a"]
[928.6568, "o", " conveyor"]
[928.6776, "o", " read-ahead for capture"]
[928.6986, "o", "-mode robustness\u2026"]
[928.7196, "o", " the user's"]
[928.7405, "o", " request is"]
[928.7614, "o", " an interactive shell"]
[928.7824, "o", " in tty mode. The capture"]
[928.8034, "o", "-mode limitation is"]
[928.8243, "o", " about"]
[928.8452, "o", " my"]
[928.866, "o", " own"]
[928.8868, "o", " scripted testing."]
[928.9078, "o", " Ship"]
[928.9286, "o", " the tty fix"]
[928.9497, "o", " first,"]
[928.9707, "o", " verify, and"]
[928.9918, "o", " deliver."]
[929.0128, "o", " I can mention the capture"]
[929.0338, "o", " quirk"]
[929.0548, "o", " briefly.\r\r\n\r\r\nOK, let me"]
[929.0549, "o", " write"]
[929.076, "o", " the fixed"]
[929.097, "o", " sh source"]
[929.1179, "o", " now.\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[929.139, "o", "Stuck"]
[929.16, "o", " session killed. Now"]
[929.16, "o", " rebuilding"]
[929.181, "o", " `sh` with the"]
[929.2021, "o", " fix \u2014 stage 0"]
[929.2231, "o", " of a pipeline gets `/dev/null`"]
[929.2442, "o", " on"]
[929.2651, "o", " fd 0"]
[929.2861, "o", " before exec, so the supervisor's"]
[929.3072, "o", " fd"]
[929.3281, "o", "-0 surgery has nothing to target and"]
[929.3492, "o", " file opens land on"]
[929.3703, "o", " normal fds:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[942.7145, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  compile sh.c\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[942.7903, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0 sha256:a684bfb1947b85d0f12830c0654e7ae254fe847ddf0b825433745421caf5a57c\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[946.3529, "o", "\u001b[2mNext, I'll re"]
[946.3739, "o", "-run pty"]
[946.3948, "o", "test against the fixed shell. If"]
[946.4159, "o", " it passes, I'll"]
[946.4369, "o", " start the shell in"]
[946.4579, "o", " tty mode"]
[946.4789, "o", " for the user.\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[946.6264, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/ptytest\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[946.9065, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[947.31, "o", "\u001b[2m**PASS!** The"]
[947.3309, "o", " fixed shell survives the"]
[947.3519, "o", " pipeline in"]
[947.3729, "o", " interactive tty mode:\r\r\n"]
[947.3729, "o", "-"]
[947.394, "o", " Phase 2: `"]
[947.4149, "o", "cat /"]
[947.4359, "o", "data/readme"]
[947.4569, "o", ".txt | head -1` \u2192 output"]
[947.478, "o", ", and then"]
[947.4989, "o", " the `potem"]
[947.52, "o", "kin> ` prompt"]
[947.541, "o", " came back!\r\r\n- Phase 3"]
[947.5621, "o", ": `pwd` \u2192"]
[947.5831, "o", " responded with `/`"]
[947.6041, "o", "\r\r\n- Phase 4: `exit"]
[947.6253, "o", "` \u2192"]
[947.6464, "o", " the shell"]
[947.6674, "o", " terminated"]
[947.6883, "o", " normally"]
[947.7092, "o", " with"]
[947.73, "o", " exit code 0 ("]
[947.751, "o", "EIO"]
[947.7719, "o", " on the"]
[947.7929, "o", " pty ="]
[947.814, "o", " slave side closed"]
[947.835, "o", " ="]
[947.8559, "o", " clean exit)\r\r\n\r\r\nThe /"]
[947.8769, "o", "dev/null fix"]
[947.8979, "o", " worked. Next, let"]
[947.919, "o", " me also"]
[947.94, "o", " re"]
[947.9608, "o", "-verify"]
[947.9818, "o", " that the capture mode"]
[948.0029, "o", " smoke test"]
[948.0239, "o", " (basic commands) still works"]
[948.045, "o", ", and then start the shell in tty"]
[948.0662, "o", " mode for the user.\r\r\n\r\r\nActually,"]
[948.0872, "o", " let's do a"]
[948.1084, "o", " final"]
[948.1292, "o", " quick"]
[948.1501, "o", " capture"]
[948.1709, "o", " smoke test on"]
[948.1919, "o", " the fixed shell to confirm"]
[948.2131, "o", " there"]
[948.2341, "o", " are no regressions"]
[948.2551, "o", " in"]
[948.276, "o", " non"]
[948.2968, "o", "-tty mode ("]
[948.3179, "o", "single commands,"]
[948.3389, "o", " builtins,"]
[948.3599, "o", " redirects)."]
[948.3808, "o", " After that,"]
[948.4018, "o", " start it in tty mode.\r\r\n\r\r\nThe"]
[948.4229, "o", " user has"]
[948.4439, "o", " already asked"]
[948.4648, "o", " three times"]
[948.4859, "o", " \u2014"]
[948.5067, "o", " time to"]
[948.5278, "o", " deliver."]
[948.5488, "o", " One"]
[948.5697, "o", " quick"]
[948.5906, "o", " smoke test, then start in tty mode"]
[948.6117, "o", ".\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n**PASS"]
[948.6328, "o", "** \u2014 the"]
[948.6538, "o", " fixed shell survives the pipeline in interactive"]
[948.6749, "o", " mode:"]
[948.6958, "o", " prompt returns after"]
[948.7169, "o", " `cat | head`, `pwd`"]
[948.7379, "o", " answers,"]
[948.759, "o", " clean `exit`."]
[948.7802, "o", " One final"]
[948.8013, "o", " regression check in capture mode, then"]
[948.8224, "o", " handing"]
[948.8433, "o", " you the console:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[949.2217, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/sh\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[949.3008, "o", "\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[949.8491, "o", "\u001b[2mThe capture mode"]
[949.8701, "o", " smoke test works"]
[949.8912, "o", " for"]
[949.9122, "o", " everything except the"]
[949.9332, "o", " known"]
[949.9541, "o", " limitations ("]
[949.9751, "o", "lines after a"]
[949.9961, "o", " two-stage pipeline"]
[950.0171, "o", " of external commands"]
[950.0381, "o", " get"]
[950.059, "o", " cut off \u2014"]
[950.0801, "o", " here, `"]
[950.101, "o", "cd /data"]
[950.122, "o", "; pwd"]
[950.1429, "o", "` after"]
[950.1639, "o", " `ls / | head -3"]
[950.1849, "o", "`:"]
[950.2058, "o", " pwd"]
[950.2266, "o", " shows `/"]
[950.2477, "o", "` instead of `/data`."]
[950.2687, "o", " That"]
[950.2896, "o", " means"]
[950.3106, "o", " `cd`"]
[950.3106, "o", " didn't"]
[950.3316, "o", " get"]
[950.3525, "o", " processed"]
[950.3734, "o", "\u2026 no wait, the"]
[950.3944, "o", " pwd output"]
[950.4154, "o", " is `/` \u2014 so"]
[950.4365, "o", " `cd /data`"]
[950.4575, "o", " wasn't executed ("]
[950.4785, "o", "cut off after the pipeline"]
[950.4997, "o", " line), and"]
[950.5208, "o", " then `pwd` ran in"]
[950.5419, "o", " `/`. This is the"]
[950.5629, "o", " documented capture-mode limitation ("]
[950.5839, "o", "the feed"]
[950.6049, "o", " protocol"]
[950.6258, "o", " kills"]
[950.6467, "o", " input after a"]
[950.6677, "o", " two-stage pipeline"]
[950.6887, "o", " of exec"]
[950.7097, "o", "'d commands). In"]
[950.7308, "o", " TTY mode"]
[950.7518, "o", " \u2014 which is what"]
[950.7729, "o", " the user"]
[950.7939, "o", " actually gets \u2014"]
[950.8149, "o", " this"]
[950.8359, "o", " doesn't"]
[950.8569, "o", " apply ("]
[950.8779, "o", "verified"]
[950.8988, "o", " PASS with ptytest).\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[950.9199, "o", "Everything else"]
[950.9409, "o", " works:"]
[950.9619, "o", " help, ls, echo"]
[950.9829, "o", ">redirect, cat,"]
[951.0039, "o", " single-stage pipeline ("]
[951.025, "o", "ls | head"]
[951.046, "o", " -3 \u2014"]
[951.067, "o", " one"]
[951.088, "o", " exec stage\u2026"]
[951.1091, "o", " no wait,"]
[951.1302, "o", " `ls / | head -3`"]
[951.1513, "o", " is two stages"]
[951.1723, "o", ", both exec'd \u2014"]
[951.1934, "o", " and"]
[951.2143, "o", " yet it"]
[951.2353, "o", " worked"]
[951.2561, "o", " here?!"]
[951.2771, "o", " Interesting \u2014 the output"]
[951.2982, "o", " shows"]
[951.319, "o", " 3 lines"]
[951.34, "o", " from ls /"]
[951.3611, "o", " ("]
[951.382, "o", "truncated"]
[951.4029, "o", " by head"]
[951.4239, "o", " -3"]
[951.4449, "o", ":"]
[951.4659, "o", " //sys, //src, //state"]
[951.487, "o", " \u2014"]
[951.5078, "o", " that's 3 lines"]
[951.5288, "o", " \u2713). And the"]
[951.5499, "o", " pipeline"]
[951.5708, "o", "'s"]
[951.5708, "o", " output was"]
[951.5918, "o", " captured."]
[951.6128, "o", " But"]
[951.6337, "o", " the subsequent"]
[951.6547, "o", " cd"]
[951.6756, "o", " didn't run."]
[951.6966, "o", " So: the pipeline"]
[951.7177, "o", " itself ran"]
[951.7388, "o", " fine (the"]
[951.76, "o", " /dev/null fix"]
[951.7811, "o", " works in capture mode too"]
[951.8021, "o", "!), and"]
[951.8231, "o", " it"]
[951.844, "o", "'s"]
[951.8649, "o", " only"]
[951.8858, "o", " the subsequent input"]
[951.9069, "o", " lines that got cut off"]
[951.9279, "o", " (the feed protocol"]
[951.9489, "o", "'s grace). The"]
[951.97, "o", " pipeline output is"]
[951.991, "o", " visible. Good"]
[952.012, "o", " \u2014"]
[952.0329, "o", " consistent with the known limitation.\r\r\n\r\r\nNow"]
[952.054, "o", ", delivery: start"]
[952.0751, "o", " /generated/bin/sh in"]
[952.0961, "o", " TTY mode"]
[952.1171, "o", " so the user can"]
[952.1382, "o", " use it."]
[952.1592, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[952.1802, "o", "spawn"]
[952.2011, "o", "(exe=/generated/bin/sh, mode"]
[952.2222, "o", "=\"tty\") \u2014"]
[952.2432, "o", " hand"]
[952.2642, "o", " the console"]
[952.2852, "o", " over to the"]
[952.3064, "o", " shell.\r\r\n\r\r\nAfter that,"]
[952.3275, "o", " give"]
[952.3484, "o", " the user a brief summary:"]
[952.3695, "o", " what the shell"]
[952.3905, "o", " can do,"]
[952.4115, "o", " and"]
[952.4325, "o", " how to"]
[952.4535, "o", " quit"]
[952.4744, "o", ".\r\r\n\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[952.4954, "o", "Capture mode is"]
[952.5165, "o", " clean ("]
[952.5375, "o", "the one"]
[952.5585, "o", " known quirk:"]
[952.5796, "o", " in *scripted*"]
[952.6006, "o", " sessions,"]
[952.6216, "o", " input"]
[952.6425, "o", " after a two-stage pipeline"]
[952.6635, "o", " is cut"]
[952.6845, "o", " \u2014 but that"]
[952.7055, "o", " doesn't affect the interactive"]
[952.7266, "o", " console"]
[952.7475, "o", "). Starting your shell"]
[952.7686, "o", " now:\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[952.8745, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[2m  spawn /generated/bin/sh [tty]\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[952.9482, "o", "PotemkinOS shell \u2014 type 'help' for commands, 'exit' to quit.\r\npotemkin> "]
[984.307, "o", "ls /generated/bin\r\n-    40692 /generated/bin/ptytest\r\n-    33952 /generated/bin/head\r\n-    65856 /generated/bin/sh\r\n-    65980 /generated/bin/sh_dbg\r\n-    38572 /generated/bin/probe2\r\nd     4096 /generated/bin/..\r\n-    49536 /generated/bin/procscan\r\n-    66284 /generated/bin/sh2\r\n-    48760 /generated/bin/fdscan\r\n-    28788 /generated/bin/cat\r\n-    27992 /generated/bin/sleep_ms\r\n-    43912 /generated/bin/ls\r\n-    43260 /generated/bin/rm\r\nd     4096 /generated/bin/.\r\n-    37116 /generated/bin/probe\r\npotemkin> "]
[990.7525, "o", "echo hi from the shell\r\nhi from the shell\r\npotemkin> "]
[996.477, "o", "exit\r\n\u001b[2m    exit=0\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[997.1169, "o", "\u001b[2mInteresting \u2014 the"]
[997.1376, "o", " tty session has already"]
[997.1585, "o", " been"]
[997.1791, "o", " interacted with"]
[997.1998, "o", " (the user typed"]
[997.2207, "o", " `ls /generated/bin`, `"]
[997.2207, "o", "echo"]
[997.2415, "o", " hi from the shell`, and then `"]
[997.2624, "o", "exit`"]
[997.2832, "o", " \u2014 the"]
[997.3039, "o", " session"]
[997.3246, "o", " terminated with exit code 0). The"]
[997.3456, "o", " user is"]
[997.3665, "o", " now using the shell!"]
[997.3874, "o", " The output"]
[997.4082, "o", " shows that they"]
[997.4291, "o", " listed the"]
[997.45, "o", " bin directory,"]
[997.4708, "o", " tested"]
[997.4916, "o", " echo, and"]
[997.5124, "o", " exited.\r\r\n\r\r\nSo the"]
[997.5333, "o", " shell is working"]
[997.5542, "o", " interactively"]
[997.5751, "o", " \u2014"]
[997.5958, "o", " the user has already"]
[997.6167, "o", " run"]
[997.6375, "o", " a"]
[997.6583, "o", " session."]
[997.6791, "o", " They typed"]
[997.7, "o", " commands"]
[997.7207, "o", ","]
[997.7415, "o", " saw the output, and exited."]
[997.7624, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\nNow,"]
[997.7832, "o", " I should"]
[997.8041, "o", " reply concisely"]
[997.825, "o", ":"]
[997.8457, "o", " the shell is"]
[997.8666, "o", " built and"]
[997.8875, "o", " was"]
[997.9082, "o", " running; it's"]
[997.9292, "o", " proven"]
[997.95, "o", " to work (the user"]
[997.9709, "o", "'s"]
[997.9918, "o", " own session: ls"]
[998.0128, "o", ", echo, exit"]
[998.0337, "o", " all worked)."]
[998.0546, "o", " Explain what"]
[998.0754, "o", "'s available,"]
[998.0963, "o", " and"]
[998.1171, "o", " how to"]
[998.138, "o", " restart ("]
[998.1589, "o", "type"]
[998.1796, "o", " the"]
[998.2004, "o", " command to"]
[998.2212, "o", " me"]
[998.242, "o", ","]
[998.2629, "o", " and I'll"]
[998.2838, "o", " start it"]
[998.3047, "o", " up again"]
[998.3257, "o", " in tty mode).\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[998.3467, "o", "Keep it short \u2014"]
[998.3677, "o", " it's a text"]
[998.3887, "o", " console."]
[998.4097, "o", " Also"]
[998.4305, "o", " mention the"]
[998.4515, "o", " caveat"]
[998.4723, "o", " about pipelines (stage 1's"]
[998.4933, "o", " stdin"]
[998.5142, "o", " = /dev/null)"]
[998.5143, "o", " and the"]
[998.5352, "o", " debugging"]
[998.556, "o", " tools"]
[998.5769, "o", " I built."]
[998.5979, "o", " And"]
[998.6187, "o", " let them know:"]
[998.6398, "o", " just say \""]
[998.6608, "o", "start the shell\""]
[998.6819, "o", " anytime and I'll"]
[998.7031, "o", " relaunch it.\r\r\n"]
[998.7031, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nYour"]
[998.7242, "o", " shell is"]
[998.7451, "o", " built and"]
[998.7661, "o", " it already"]
[998.7871, "o", " took a"]
[998.808, "o", " session \u2014 you"]
[998.829, "o", " listed"]
[998.8498, "o", " `/generated/bin`,"]
[998.8708, "o", " echoed, and"]
[998.8917, "o", " exited cleanly."]
[998.9125, "o", " It's ready"]
[998.9335, "o", " whenever you"]
[998.9544, "o", " are"]
[998.9752, "o", "; just"]
[998.996, "o", " tell me to start"]
[999.017, "o", " it and I'll"]
[999.0379, "o", " hand you the console"]
[999.0588, "o", " again (`"]
[999.0797, "o", "spawn"]
[999.1005, "o", " sh` in tty"]
[999.1215, "o", " mode).\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[999.1425, "o", "What"]
[999.1635, "o", " you have:\r\r\n\r\r\n- **"]
[999.1845, "o", "`"]
[999.2054, "o", "sh`** \u2014 the"]
[999.2264, "o", " shell:"]
[999.2474, "o", " prompt"]
[999.2683, "o", ", builtins"]
[999.2893, "o", " (`help`, `"]
[999.3104, "o", "echo`, `"]
[999.3315, "o", "cd`, `pwd`, `"]
[999.3526, "o", "exit`),"]
[999.3735, "o", " quotes,"]
[999.3945, "o", " `>`, `"]
[999.4155, "o", ">>`,"]
[999.4365, "o", " `"]
[999.4573, "o", "<`,"]
[999.4782, "o", " and pipes"]
[999.4991, "o", " (`a | b"]
[999.5201, "o", "`, spaces around"]
[999.5411, "o", " `|`)\r\r\n- **"]
[999.5622, "o", "Commands** \u2014 `ls`, `cat"]
[999.5833, "o", "`, `head`, `rm`"]
[999.6043, "o", " in `/generated/bin`;"]
[999.6253, "o", " more"]
[999.6462, "o", " on"]
[999.667, "o", " request\r\r\n- **"]
[999.688, "o", "`HOME"]
[999.709, "o", "=/data`**, `"]
[999.73, "o", "PATH=/"]
[999.751, "o", "generated/bin:/"]
[999.772, "o", "bin:/usr"]
[999.793, "o", "/bin`\r\r\n\r\r\nTwo"]
[999.8141, "o", " things"]
[999.835, "o", " I"]
[999.856, "o", " had to"]
[999.8771, "o", " fight"]
[999.8981, "o", " through,"]
[999.9192, "o", " so you know the"]
[999.9402, "o", " edges:\r\r\n\r\r\n1."]
[999.9613, "o", " The session supervisor"]
[999.9823, "o", " rewires"]
[1000.0033, "o", " fd"]
[1000.0242, "o", " 0 on"]
[1000.0451, "o", " pipeline"]
[1000.066, "o", " stage"]
[1000.0869, "o", "-1 children ("]
[1000.1079, "o", "it dead"]
[1000.1289, "o", "locked `cat"]
[1000.1499, "o", " file | head"]
[1000.1499, "o", "`)."]
[1000.1709, "o", " Fixed by giving stage"]
[1000.1919, "o", " 1 `/dev/null`"]
[1000.2129, "o", " on stdin \u2014 so"]
[1000.234, "o", " pagers"]
[1000.255, "o", " like `"]
[1000.276, "o", "less`"]
[1000.297, "o", " don't"]
[1000.318, "o", " work"]
[1000.3389, "o", " *inside*"]
[1000.3599, "o", " pipelines; run them"]
[1000.3809, "o", " standalone.\r\r\n2. In"]
[1000.402, "o", " *scripted* (non-tty"]
[1000.423, "o", ") sessions,"]
[1000.4442, "o", " input lines"]
[1000.4653, "o", " after a two-stage pipeline"]
[1000.4863, "o", " get"]
[1000.5071, "o", " cut off"]
[1000.5281, "o", "."]
[1000.549, "o", " Your interactive console is unaffected"]
[1000.57, "o", " \u2014 verified"]
[1000.591, "o", " with a"]
[1000.5911, "o", " full pty test"]
[1000.612, "o", ": pipeline"]
[1000.633, "o", " ran,"]
[1000.654, "o", " prompt came back, `pwd` answered"]
[1000.6751, "o", ", clean `exit`."]
[1000.6752, "o", "\r\r\n\r\r\n"]
[1000.6961, "o", "Debug"]
[1000.717, "o", "ging tools"]
[1000.738, "o", " are"]
[1000.7589, "o", " kept in `/"]
[1000.7799, "o", "generated/bin`"]
[1000.8009, "o", " (`"]
[1000.8218, "o", "fdscan`, `"]
[1000.8428, "o", "procscan`, `pty"]
[1000.8639, "o", "test`, `probe`, `sleep"]
[1000.885, "o", "_ms`)"]
[1000.906, "o", " \u2014 say"]
[1000.927, "o", " the word if you want"]
[1000.948, "o", " them removed or"]
[1000.969, "o", " turned into"]
[1000.99, "o", " something"]
[1001.0109, "o", " useful."]
[1001.011, "o", "\r\r\n"]
[1001.1344, "o", "\r\r\n> "]
